","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/1e3a5dbbbe8282ce652cec7223ba2b01f1413f45","node_id":"C_kwDORYWfptoAKDFlM2E1ZGJiYmU4MjgyY2U2NTJjZWM3MjIzYmEyYjAxZjE0MTNmNDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb","sha":"73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb"}],"sha":"1e3a5dbbbe8282ce652cec7223ba2b01f1413f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/1e3a5dbbbe8282ce652cec7223ba2b01f1413f45"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:34:50Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:36:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(fleet): exclude dealdesk from the public sweep; close REPO_NOTES opt-in bypass\n\nOperator ruling 2026-09-24: dealdesk (client bids, proposals, engagements) never reaches the public blog. Moved from REPO_NOTES to EXCLUDED_REPOS and removed its drafter-prompt bullet in generate-article.ts, which would have described the client work even without a sweep.\n\nThe private-repo opt-in used `r.name in notes`, which a repo named constructor/toString/hasOwnProperty would satisfy through Object.prototype. Both membership checks are now own-property checks, with a regression test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ce801916d3fdee54013882ea9611483ce4fd1cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/0ce801916d3fdee54013882ea9611483ce4fd1cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb","node_id":"C_kwDORYWfptoAKDczYTE2ZjBkNzFlNWQ2Njg4YzFkYmQwZTVmNzMwOWQyMmE5NTAxZmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a","sha":"e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a"}],"sha":"73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/73a16f0d71e5d6688c1dbd0e5f7309d22a9501fb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:29:34Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:36:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(fleet): sweep private repos only when opted in via REPO_NOTES\n\nImplements the operator ruling of 2026-09-24 on PR #280: the blog is public,\nso discovery now requests `visibility` and sweeps a PRIVATE/INTERNAL repo only\nwhen REPO_NOTES has an entry for it. Un-noted private repos are skipped with a\nsingle ::warning:: listing their names (nothing else). Public repos are always\nswept, as before. Missing/unknown visibility is treated as non-public.\n\nReverse drift (lost-token guard): a REPO_NOTES repo absent from discovery emits\n`::warning::fleet drift: noted repo(s) not discovered: ...`; if discovery returns\nzero non-public repos while noted repos are missing and public ones are present\n(the GH_PAT-lost-private-scope signature), discovery throws.\n\nExisting guards (gh error, unparseable, empty, all-filtered) are unchanged.\n\nTests cover skip+warn, opted-in private swept, public always swept, noted\nmissing warns, lost private scope throws. The >1 MB closed-PR test now uses an\nexecSync mock that enforces maxBuffer (ENOBUFS), so it fails without the fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"341a8be959df69cd92d714e580c8d25f9bf87930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/341a8be959df69cd92d714e580c8d25f9bf87930"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a","node_id":"C_kwDORYWfptoAKGU1NzU1MGViOWNmNGNmZGMyZTYyODk4NDlkYTRhMGI3ODM1MDg5NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8","sha":"eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8"}],"sha":"e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/e57550eb9cf4cfdc2e6289849da4a0b78350895a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:03:46Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:36:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"test(smoke): pin the sweep to this repo via a FLEET_REPOS seam\n\nThe PR smoke test runs the real sweep under the Actions token with a fixed\nDATE_OVERRIDE=2026-01-01, so every PR in the org is \"recent\"; once the busy\nrepos'' PR lists parsed (the buffer fix), the per-PR skill-comment scrape\nfanned out to hundreds of gh calls and the job hit its 5-minute timeout\n(run 36070106221; the step already took 3–4 min on the last three green\nruns). FLEET_REPOS=\"a,b\" pins the sweep set for tests and local replays;\nthe scheduled workflows never set it — membership there stays derived.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"80bf6e0e4bc98ea051ab76a402acbf68b955894b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/80bf6e0e4bc98ea051ab76a402acbf68b955894b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8","node_id":"C_kwDORYWfptoAKGViN2M3NDkxYjVmZmM5ZWIxY2U2OWE5ZmZhNjg0ZTBiYmZkODg5Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7","sha":"a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7"}],"sha":"eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/eb7c7491b5ffc9eb1ce69a9ffa684e0bbfd889b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T22:54:23Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T23:36:05Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(collector): derive the sweep set from gh repo list; stop --paginate overflowing execSync\n\nTwo defects behind the 2026-08-21 → 09-24 silent sweep (35 green no-op days):\n\n- Surface 2 (the swept repo set) was a hand-maintained REPOS array. Four repos\n  founded outside /fleet-onboard were invisible: lego-village-pipeline +\n  play-well-library (09-17; 74 commits, 20 merged PRs), dealdesk (08-19),\n  foundry-recipes (04-30). Membership now comes from `gh repo list ojfbot`\n  (non-archived, non-fork, minus EXCLUDED_REPOS) in the new src/fleet.ts;\n  discovery failure throws so the run goes red instead of \"no activity\".\n- `gh api … --paginate` on the per_page-capped list endpoints walked every\n  page (core closed PRs ≈ 5.9 MB), overflowing execSync''s 1 MB default\n  maxBuffer, so shell/cv-builder/core/daily-logger merged PRs, recent PRs and\n  closed issues were silently \"skipped\" on every run — including the 08-19\n  run that still produced candidates. Single page per call, 16 MB buffer.\n  core#487 (09-17) and #488 (09-23) would have produced articles.\n\nSurfaces 3–4 stay explicit but loud: KNOWN_REPOS is derived from REPO_NOTES\n(fleet.ts) and build-api''s repo tag types from KNOWN_REPOS (closes the\n2026-05-05 set/map asymmetry); reportSurfaceDrift() prints a ::warning:: for\nany swept repo missing a note or a SYSTEM_PROMPT bullet. Backport-registers\nthe four repos on surfaces 3–4.\n\nVerified: 133 tests (10 new), lint + type-check clean; live replay of the\n2026-09-18 window now yields 50 repos, core recent PRs incl. #487, 74 lvp\ncommits, and zero closed-PR skips.\n\nNot in scope: ADR-0033 / ADR-0035 (core, Proposed) remain unimplemented.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"42052eb817cbb33f86da30ad6999c3bf0210be4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/42052eb817cbb33f86da30ad6999c3bf0210be4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7","node_id":"C_kwDORYWfptoAKGE5ZmU5Nzk5MjVmMjE2N2MyYWE3ZTkwYzk5MjdiYTI2MzEwM2E4ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/daily-logger/commit/6fd80ea799559f52973423641d786b45dc891551","sha":"6fd80ea799559f52973423641d786b45dc891551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/6fd80ea799559f52973423641d786b45dc891551"}],"sha":"a9fe979925f2167c2aa7e90c9927ba263103a8d7","url"