_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/commits/12cdacb434ed87bb1a085705e0ac296b0b670ab4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T17:56:32Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T19:30:37Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(evals): S19 first golden suite — 10 tasks seeded from failure-taxonomy v1\n\nevals/ golden eval suite (audit program rm:rm-l2-ojfbot#S19, integration plan\nI4), seeded EXCLUSIVELY from core/decisions/failure-taxonomy.md v1 and the\nreal July failures it catalogues. 10 tasks across 4 clusters:\n\n- failure:no-validation-gate (5): replay of the 07-03/-04 corrupted-registry\n  failure (0004-narrow-su truncation, title-less 0005-0007) through the\n  validation ladder, prompt assembly, and a raw-prompt-fragment tripwire\n  over the committed corpus\n- failure:blind-retry (2): end-to-end honest-failure-stub replay via the\n  real-call path against an unroutable endpoint (3 trials), plus the\n  diagnosed-retry contract on getValidationErrors\n- failure:silent-stall (1): \"post exists\" machine-checked over _articles/\n- failure:asserted-not-verified (2): H0.3 ghost-file claim flagged by\n  verifyFileExistenceClaims; corpus status/outcome enum conformance\n\nHarness: pnpm eval runs vitest (evals/vitest.config.ts, hermetic — no LLM\njudging, no network beyond localhost-refused), snapshots per-task pass/fail\nto evals/results/latest.json, and prints the diff vs the committed snapshot.\npr-check.yml gains an advisory step (continue-on-error: true) that posts the\ndiff to the job summary — it never blocks; promotion to blocking is a later\ndata-gated RIDM decision (S16 pattern). pnpm test unchanged (115 green).\n\nFix surfaced by the suite''s first run: validateArticleOutput(undefined, date)\nwithout a snippet threw TypeError inside the last-resort stub branch\n(JSON.stringify(undefined) is undefined); stub construction now cannot throw.\n\nOracle: flips audit-delivery-check I4.1 (\"no evals/ dir or golden/eval test\nfiles\") to DELIVERED — predicate replicated locally against this tree.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EUhTAqJ1pfd8Ye51KMcr84","tree":{"sha":"e68dd90d353942d4292b379a4a2cfa11f35342e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/e68dd90d353942d4292b379a4a2cfa11f35342e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/12cdacb434ed87bb1a085705e0ac296b0b670ab4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},