2-ojfbot#S18 (plan I2): record the human editorial\nverdict as an optional `outcome` frontmatter field (accepted|edited|\nrejected|abandoned), distinct from `status` (publication lane).\n\n- schema.ts: ARTICLE_OUTCOMES enum + optional outcome on ArticleDataSchema\n  (ARTICLE_STATUSES and status semantics untouched)\n- stamp-outcome.ts: mechanical byte-preserving frontmatter stamp (shared\n  function + CLI); never LLM-written\n- revise-article.ts (ADR-0038 path): a successful non-dry-run revision\n  stamps outcome: edited before the single write\n- editorial-revise.yml: new stamp-accept job — an accept/<date> PR opened\n  WITHOUT feedback gets outcome: accepted stamped on the PR branch; the\n  stamp only reaches main when the human merges (gate-0 stays human)\n- build-api.ts: parse + emit outcome (closed-enum guarded); accept default\n  at the status line untouched (S11 territory)\n- tests: stampOutcome (7) + schema outcome enum (2)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EUhTAqJ1pfd8Ye51KMcr84","tree":{"sha":"0a4b923966daf8af874b7a3ddb4bba2071441d38","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/0a4b923966daf8af874b7a3ddb4bba2071441d38"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/223b86d085fdc1fc612fd3de9cf56a601af7d956","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","receiv