06d4c39334/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T16:06:56Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T17:38:59Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(trace): S21 trace identity — parse Claude-Session commit trailers (I1.2)\n\nThe Claude Code harness appends `Claude-Session: <url>` and\n`Co-Authored-By:` trailers to every commit it makes; nothing consumed\nthem. parseCommitTrailers (collect-context.ts) now extracts both from\nthe full commit message and surfaces sessionUrl / coAuthors on\nCommitInfo, so articles can join commits → sessions.\n\nSHADOW: parsed and surfaced only — fields are optional, trailer-less\ncommits are a no-op, downstream prose generation may ignore them.\nUnit-tested (parseCommitTrailers.test.ts, 6 cases).\n\nRoadmap-Ref: rm:rm-l2-ojfbot#S21\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EUhTAqJ1pfd8Ye51KMcr84","tree":{"sha":"5d47519dea03aece97d3641c74751e13630eb3cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/trees/5d47519dea03aece97d3641c74751e13630eb3cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/daily-logger/git/commits/2552ca44eee81406e4f464d64d1b8006d4c39334","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c