547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/5e20b70e8675929bce4e9620f9c621ed5e0e7b94/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:06:25Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:06:25Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(desktop): keep the bootstrap-cwd fs double separator-agnostic\n\nThe Windows-anchor tests were written (and verified) on macOS, where\n`join` keeps the fixtures'' forward slashes. On the Windows runner — their\nfirst real execution, in the v4.0.0 release job — `join` renders the\nderived newRoot/oldRoot paths with backslashes, the double''s `under`/\n`direct` string surgery (`startsWith(dir + ''/'')`) stopped recognizing\nchildren, a seeded non-empty executable root classified as empty, and the\nsource dutifully migrated over it: four assertions failed with\n\"expected { …(2) } to be undefined\". Containment now matches either\nseparator.\n\nVerified on macOS (18/18) and under simulated win32 path semantics in\nboth the test and the module (18/18) — the exact CI fai