ved_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/2f6ae41a7ed40968266b50abc080b97f010ac1d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:45:48Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:45:48Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"⬆️ chore(release): bump app version to 4.0.0-rc.3\n\nAll eight app-version mirrors (root pom revision, .mvn/maven.config,\nfrontend + desktop package.json, four official plugin manifests) move to\n4.0.0-rc.3. CHANGELOG gains the 4.0.0-rc.3 section — first-install\nwizard fix, slow-hardware boot deadlines, unsigned-build native update\nrefusal, plugin UI entry tickets, lazy AI startup, the self-hosted\nupgrade-channel posture gate, and the rc.2 production-review findings —\nand the docs EN/ZH changelog mirrors are regenerated.","tree":{"sha":"fea510164bef416bf6cd2d8066bcfc3527223135","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/fea510164bef416bf6cd2d8066bcfc3527223135"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/2f6ae41a7ed40968266b50abc080b97f010ac1d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/2f6ae41a7ed40968266b50abc080b97f010ac1d4","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDJmNmFlNDFhN2VkNDA5NjgyNjZiNTBhYmMwODBiOTdmMDEwYWMxZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e","sha":"0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e"}],"sha":"2f6ae41a7ed40968266b50abc080b97f010ac1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/2f6ae41a7ed40968266b50abc080b97f010ac1d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:45:41Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:45:41Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(frontend): first install enters the app after the database wizard\n\nThe renderer boot gate stayed closed forever after the SETUP→APP restart:\nthe gate flag was never set when the boot probe redirected to the wizard,\nso completing the wizard landed on the BootGate skeleton instead of the\nmain shell until a manual reload. The gate now opens on every probe\noutcome (finally), the wizard''s restart wait matches the desktop shell''s\n2-minute boot patience (was 30s — a false timeout on slow hardware while\nthe backend was still legitimately starting), and a timeout offers a\nreload button. waitForAppMode is extracted per the aiChatComposer\nprecedent, with unit tests pinning the 404-means-APP-mode contract.","tree":{"sha":"c7f8e96521550b2b227df688881d404c344d3ade","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/c7f8e96521550b2b227df688881d404c344d3ade"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDBiZjM3NWI0MDAxNTFmMDNmNjJkYzg5M2QzOWMzY2Q2MDdiM2UyOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88","sha":"34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88"}],"sha":"0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/0bf375b400151f03f62dc893d39c3cd607b3e28e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T15:38:23Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MaskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T15:38:23Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MaskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix: resolve the P1/P2 findings from the 4.0.0-rc.2 production review\n\nBackend (P1 security/data-integrity):\n- H2 TCP server no longer passes -ifNotExists — a loopback caller must not\n  mint a database and run Java aliases in the host JVM; e2e-smoke pre-seeds\n  the DB the way SETUP does to match\n- ChatArtifactStore keeps the staging tree (and surfaces a FAILED marker\n  with the rescue path) when artifact registration fails, instead of\n  revoking the grant and destroying the only copy\n- StoreService retains the install journal + backups when a rollback fails\n  and retries recovery under the transaction lock instead of refusing with\n  \"already in progress\"\n- SelfUpdateService follows bounded, validated redirects (JDK HttpClient\n  defaults to NEVER; GitHub assets are 302s) and refuses https→http\n  downgrades; new SelfUpdateRedirectTest covers the hop rules\n- WorkflowWebhookController verifies the secret before reading any body\n  bytes and enforces the payload cap on the stream itself\n\nDesktop (P1): the Windows portable replace-bat treats a still-failing\nrobocopy retry (exit >= 8) as an explicit FAILED state — keeps staging,\nlogs and the app tree for manual recovery, never relaunches a mixed\nold/new tree.\n\nPlugins (P2):\n- email: in-flight sends are leased against the stale SENDING sweep, and a\n  misfired reclaim is reconciled to the send''s true terminal state\n- offlinepython: pip receives the full extracted wheel path (the basename\n  form always exited 1); offlinepython-e2e-smoke resolves artifacts by\n  glob and stages the checksum sidecar\n\nFrontend (P2): aiSession serializes saves per conversation, blocks\nunloadTurns while a save is unsaved (failed saves surface an error and\nretry with the next turn), and claims the busy slot before the first\nawait to kill double-submit races.\n\nAlso lands the rc.2 production review report, its 2026-09-19 verified\nedition, and the review-evidence logs backing them.","tree":{"sha":"447bad58c000348a87b3040b6e64ab8fd69cdc13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/447bad58c000348a87b3040b6e64ab8fd69cdc13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDM0MzA0Njg3YTZjMjNiNDM0NzgyZTkyOGE1NGY5YjgxYzhiNDVkODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3","sha":"3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3"}],"sha":"34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/34304687a6c23b434782e928a54f9b81c8b45d88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:59:09Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MaskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T14:59:09Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MaskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(desktop): refuse native installs on unsigned builds in the renderer update path\n\nP0-9 parity with the startup check in auto-updater.ts: the renderer-driven\n\"update now\" flow now enforces the same signedRelease gate before any\ndownloadUpdate()/quitAndInstall(). electron-updater''s sha512 binds the artifact\nto the feed file only, so a plain-HTTP store MITM rewrites both — integrity\nwithout publisher verification, which the consent dialog cannot carry. Unsigned\nbuilds fall back to the manual download page before the consent dialog is ever\nshown. Also ignore desktop/electron/frontend-dist/ — the CI-staged SPA copy is\na build artifact (same category as dist/ and resources/binaries/).","tree":{"sha":"f0ac7b4a77c66ad15b16f2c334eeded0841cc1fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/f0ac7b4a77c66ad15b16f2c334eeded0841cc1fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDNiODQ1NmRjZjA1YTEyZGI0N2MwNTU3YWNjZDcyNWQ2YjljYjI0YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/694d42ee40e32a18c67ab9367a0a9b4c77a80a50","sha":"694d42ee40e32a18c67ab9367a0a9b4c77a80a50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/694d42ee40e32a18c67ab9367a0a9b4c77a80a50"}],"sha":"3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/3b8456dcf05a12db47c0557accd725d6b9cb24a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/694d42ee40e32a18c67ab9367a0a9b4c77a80a50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:55:19Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:55:19Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"✨ feat: harden store/update channel posture, plugin UI entry tickets, and lazy AI startup\n\n- Store/update channel: the Settings update-channel override is now gated on the\n  self-hosted posture (fengyu.store.allow-private-network or the live toggle);\n  with the posture off the saved address stays dormant and every surface falls\n  back to the official store / mirror / GitHub\n- Plugin runtime: header-authenticated one-time ui-ticket endpoint for plugin\n  UI entry navigation, plus no-referrer / cache headers on ticketed assets\n- AI startup: lazy AiConfigProperties and ToolCallback[] compatibility beans,\n  lazy JPA repository bootstrap, and disabled MCP annotation scanning to cut\n  cold-start work\n- Desktop/frontend: update-feed and dev-frontend hardening, Vuetify auto-import\n  cleanup with a regression test, i18n and settings store updates","tree":{"sha":"6c3d35aaf51ce2d3437109bbf3a76f7be516e510","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/6c3d35aaf51ce2d3437109bbf3a76f7be516e510"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/694d42ee40e32a18c67ab9367a0a9b4c77a80a50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/694d42ee40e32a18c67ab9367a0a9b4c77a80a50","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDY5NGQ0MmVlNDBlMzJhMThjNjdhYjkzNjdhMGE5YjRjNzdhODBhNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/91c643f4c3b9cd35d388692fcdddc040e4ff89ee","sha":"91c643f4c3b9cd35d388692fcdddc040e4ff89ee","url":"https://api.gith