//github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/4dfc23af39b314235ed8b82ea39fbe10be17a00d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T09:34:26Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T09:34:26Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(ui): land the 2026-09-08 RC review wave with a host E2E suite\n\nHost frontend:\n- FlowRunDialog: native <dialog> modality with a focus trap, labelled\n  heading, and opener focus restore; FlowBuilder blocks canvas shortcuts\n  while the dialog is open\n- Settings: fold AI guard rules and hooks into collapsible \"advanced\"\n  sections with friendlier en/zh copy; reveal scroll thumbs only while\n  scrolling; keep the macOS nav below the native window-control strip\n- Theme: focus-visible outlines and primary focus borders; warn chips and\n  plugin warning statuses use the theme warning token; the teleported\n  store detail drawer inherits host theme tokens\n- FlowLibrary scrolls its own list so the last flow stays reachable at\n  the 960px minimum window\n\nplugin-markdown: drop the duplicated card title, label the editor\ntextarea, and show a visible focus outline\n\ntoolchain/ui:\n- theme contract test imports the host md3 palettes instead of\n  duplicated literals\n- new `yarn test:host` Playwright RC suite (host-rc.spec.ts) covering the\n  above regressions; the visual run stays pinned to workbench.spec.ts\n\nAlso ignore gui-test-screenshots/ (transient GUI patrol artifacts).","tree":{"sha":"501b179908646f0f0db09ee8070d19e096644456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/501b179908646f0f0db09ee8070d19e096644456"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/4dfc23af39b314235ed8b82ea39fbe10be17a00d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/4dfc23af39b314235ed8b82ea39fbe10be17a00d","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDRkZmMyM2FmMzliMzE0MjM1ZWQ4YjgyZWEzOWZiZTEwYmUxN2EwMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993","sha":"84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993"}],"sha":"4dfc23af39b314235ed8b82ea39fbe10be17a00d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/4dfc23af39b314235ed8b82ea39fbe10be17a00d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T23:07:35Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MaskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T23:07:35Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MaskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix: follow the 2026-09-07 audit with store-interop hardening and a live UI patrol pass\n\nAudit follow-ups:\n- Approval gates are credential-checked end to end: SSE events carry a gateId,\n  the client sends it on every approve, and the backend answers 409 on duplicate\n  or stale credentials while the frontend silently refreshes run state.\n- Surface the audit''s platform disclosures in the UI: install confirmations state\n  when declared plugin permissions are not OS-enforced, and the schedules form\n  selects an explicit permission mode so ask-for-approval rejections read as\n  guidance instead of a surprise.\n- Allow PATCH in CORS for the plugin-store and skill enable toggles, harden the\n  plugin runtime surfaces (file grants, process manager, installers, inspection),\n  fix the store trust-file example (Base64 X.509 DER, not PEM), and add a live\n  StoreClient interoperability probe plus fixtures for signed downloads.\n- Portable web packaging accepts absolute output directories and resolves\n  relative output paths from the caller''s working directory.\n- Sync changelog mirrors and docs; drop the stale audit notes and sdk-ts dist\n  artifacts.\n\nLive UI patrol fixes (frontend only):\n- Schedules: the shell''s main pane clips overflow, so the page now scrolls\n  itself — below-the-fold controls (permission hint, create button, schedule\n  list) are reachable again on shorter windows — and inline links follow the\n  monochrome theme instead of the browser-default blue.\n- Chat shell: remove the header \"More options\" button that never had a click\n  handler and mislead users into clicking a dead control.","tree":{"sha":"12feeb7de0155be314360f77f09d7e64f3bf5846","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/12feeb7de0155be314360f77f09d7e64f3bf5846"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDg0ZjhkODllYjM2NDY3NzZhN2ZmZGM4OWQ5N2ZiYTMwM2Y2MTA5OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe","sha":"8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe"}],"sha":"84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/84f8d89eb3646776a7ffdc89d97fba303f610993"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T09:31:21Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T09:31:21Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix: land the 2026-09-07 full-code-audit fix wave\n\nResolves the P0-P3 findings from code-audit-2026-09-07.md across the\nbackend, AI subsystem, plugin runtime, store client, frontend, and\ndesktop shell. Remaining follow-ups are tracked in\nAUDIT-FIX-REMAINING-TASKS.md.\n\nBackend & security:\n- Self-update scripts no longer leak the auth token: 0700 script perms,\n  env-based relaunch, sanitized version strings, UTF-8 batch files\n- MySQL plugin-DB grants derive the account host from the datasource\n  URL; the setup wizard confines embedded DB paths (escape-hatch\n  property); test-connection details gated on auth\n- Keychain secrets passed via stdin; four stale \"setup is token-bypassed\"\n  comments corrected; conversation message cap; SSE heartbeats\n  interrupted on emitter termination; SETUP context excludes\n  PluginHookController\n\nAI subsystem:\n- Unattended (scheduled/webhook) runs can no longer hang on approval\n  gates: creation is rejected for ask-mode workflows with uncovered\n  tools, headless approval timeout (300s), approval notifications\n  carrying the runId\n- Approval gates are guarded by a gateId: duplicate or late approves\n  return 409 instead of releasing the next gate; agent streams require\n  run ownership\n- Step wall-clock timeout (900s default); step results bounded at 16KB\n  in buffers and persistence; one-shot schedule submit failures record\n  FAILED; the conversation compactor degrades to hard truncation; CJK\n  memory tokenization; 64-step cap on direct workflows\n- MCP: exponential-backoff reconnect with immediate dispatch on call\n  failure, parallel startup under a total budget, cached tool listings;\n  disable-wildcards match whole tool names; hook timeouts kill the\n  process tree; NAT64 / IPv4-mapped SSRF guards; skill registry\n  snapshot cache; bounded metrics tags\n\nPlugins & store client:\n- Worker stdin writes go through a watchdogged queue so a stalled\n  worker can no longer wedge host threads\n- Marketplace installer: clone paths confined (path-traversal fix),\n  file:// URLs disabled by default, clone URLs policy-checked, atomic\n  installs with rollback\n- The installer dispatcher keys update gates on the real package id,\n  preventing silent rollbacks after restart\n- Store client: download tickets carry os/arch/artifactId, catalog\n  pagination followed, install-event telemetry, host version from\n  build metadata, URL-encoded type filter, bounded download retry\n- Native file grants refuse sensitive directories and are audit\n  logged; the plugin asset endpoint blocks cross-site loads; semver\n  ranges support ^/~/*; official-plugin seeding recovers after store\n  rollbacks\n\nFrontend:\n- Conversation delete/clear confirmations; centralized 401 handling\n  with a reload banner; debounced, race-guarded store search; empty\n  chat reuse; lazy unloading of inactive conversation turns; plugin\n  iframe camera grant removed; SetupWizard i18n; masked API keys never\n  echoed back; assorted UX fixes\n\nDesktop:\n- The browser-automation partition now denies permission requests by\n  default\n- Packaged builds chdir to userData before module init, fixing the\n  macOS Finder-launch crash; logger mkdir never throws\n- The header CSP drops ''unsafe-inline'', scoped to the packaged shell\n- The store update channel falls back to GitHub where the store has no\n  feed; JRE builds report \"unsupported\" clearly\n- The Vite dev spawn strips token env vars; health probes align with\n  the token-bypass contract\n\nAlso carries the pending release-branch work (calendar scheduling,\ndependency EOL bumps, docs), the full audit report, and the\nremaining-task list. Backend/frontend/desktop unit tests were\nintentionally not run in this wave; run them per section 2 of\nAUDIT-FIX-REMAINING-TASKS.md.","tree":{"sha":"701e88a8237135786f92cb6014667d6d8280bcbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/701e88a8237135786f92cb6014667d6d8280bcbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDgwMjBmOTdmMDZjMzUwNGVmYTY4MjIzNGFkYWI1ODRhYTkyNDQzZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e","sha":"98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e"}],"sha":"8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/8020f97f06c3504efa682234adab584aa92443fe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:53:31Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:53:31Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(ci): also retry audit 503s and alternate the two npm mirrors\n\nThe 2026-09-04 npm incident kept going: with the 5-minute budget the audit\nrequest completed but registry.yarnpkg.com answered HTTP 503\n(YN0035 Service Unavailable) — not matched by the network-only retry\npatterns, so the wrapper gave up after one attempt. 503s from the audit\nroute are now retryable, and retries alternate between the two official\nmirrors (registry.yarnpkg.com and registry.npmjs.org), which flapped\nindependently; the advisory data is identical.","tree":{"sha":"055c91344a2a7a40c03a481c4aa7c3fc2961a1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/055c91344a2a7a40c03a481c4aa7c3fc2961a1a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDk4Yzg1NDVjOTQwZGQwZTAyM2IyNDJkMTJmYWUyYjk5NmM0OGNlMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f","sha":"9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f"}],"sha":"98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/98c8545c940dd0e023b242d12fae2b996c48ce0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:45:36Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:45:36Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(account): drain both credential-helper pipes and probe a dead store up front\n\nThe Windows backend reads and deletes the refresh credential through a\nPowerShell helper whose stdout was drained but whose stderr never was:\nAdd-Type banners and antivirus chatter fill the unread pipe''s OS buffer,\nthe child blocks forever, and the 8-second timeout never fired — the\nwedged helper held the refresh lock and hung the user center and sign-out\nwith it. Both pipes now drain concurrently with the watchdog as the only\nbound, and the refresh lock switched to a bounded tryLock so a pathological\nhelper degrades store access to anonymous instead of hanging. Regression\ntests drive real misbehaving children (a ~1MB stderr flood; a child that\nnever exits).\n\nBrowser sign-in against an unreachable store used to sit PENDING for the\nwhole attempt window. The host now TCP-probes the channel (2s budget)\nbefore starting the flow, fails fast with an error naming the channel, and\nlogs each sign-in stage (callback → code exchange → profile → session\ncredential → binding saved).","tree":{"sha":"87052b795e7064d95429ed1c4249a04e5616098c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/87052b795e7064d95429ed1c4249a04e5616098c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDlhMDQzMTA3YTkxNGJhYTFiMTc4NzE5Mzg0YTIxMWRiYjQ0ZmQzNGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/a8e2e9cf601c2d97e2c7f00ce9087fab78d13172","sha":"a8e2e9cf601c2d97e2c7f00ce9087fab78d13172","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/a8e2e9cf601c2d97e2c7f00ce9087fab78d13172"}],"sha":"9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/9a043107a914baa1b178719384a211dbb44fd34f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercont