ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/f78d058c289a21e03087663c1832cbcb3536c1a7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T08:54:06Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T08:54:06Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"✨ feat(ai): expand browser and computer-use interaction coverage\n\nGrow the desktop browser toolset from 21 to 25 AI tools: browser_history\n(back/forward/reload, invalidating stale element refs), browser_hover and\nbrowser_scroll driven by real CDP pointer/wheel input, browser_select with\nverified native <select> option matching, and browser_press now targets the\nactive page when no selector or ref is given.\n\nComputer Use adds computer_key_sequence: up to 50 ordered keys/shortcuts\nwith a bounded inter-key pause, in one approved call.\n\nImplements the Electron bridge handlers, updates the Java tool\ndeclarations, tests, README, EN/ZH docs and CHANGELOG mirrors, and adds\nthe roadmap excalidraw assets.","tree":{"sha":"c55a86472eccfbd2e31e3facae775c16d412fa87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/c55a86472eccfbd2e31e3facae775c16d412fa87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/f78d058c289a21e03087663c1832cbcb3536c1a7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/f78d058c289a21e03087663c1832cbcb3536c1a7","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKGY3OGQwNThjMjg5YTIxZTAzMDg3NjYzYzE4MzJjYmNiMzUzNmMxYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/f78651a61ed2e1bc15444ea2c3a61f271ea26268","sha":"f78651a61ed2e1bc15444ea2c3a61f271ea26268","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/f78651a61ed2e1bc15444ea2c3a61f271ea26268"}],"sha":"f78d058c289a21e03087663c1832cbcb3536c1a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/f78d058c289a21e03087663c1832cbcb3536c1a7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/f78651a61ed2e1bc15444ea2c3a61f271ea26268/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:28:50Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T02:28:50Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"🐛 fix(desktop): hash the CSP import-map token over LF-normalized content\n\nChromium applies CSP hash sources to inline scripts after normalizing\nCRLF/CR to LF. Computing the token over raw HTML bytes made every\nWindows-runner desktop build (CRLF checkout) bake a hash Chromium\nrejects: the import map was blocked, vue could not resolve, and the\npackaged app white-screened (4.0.0-rc.1 win32 portable/installer/JRE).\n\nverify-frontend-dist now re-computes every inline script token the way\nChromium does, so the packaging gate fails instead of shipping a\nblank-window build. Regression test pins the rc.1 defect shape.","tree":{"sha":"23d268fa34deb67be48673c46cc47e6854ae325e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/23d268fa34deb67be48673c46cc47e6854ae325e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/f78651a61ed2e1bc15444ea2c3a61f271ea26268","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskS