,"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/8ef8901524e521b92489ff7ef8d7e7a7df1a897d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T10:33:35Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T10:33:35Z","email":"gitman@outlook.sg","name":"MuskStark"},"message":"✨ feat(ai): enforce JSON schema contracts across plugin RPC and Flow\n\nAdd JsonSchemaContractValidator and enforce generated manifest schemas at\nevery trust boundary: PluginProcessManager validates input before worker\ndispatch and output after it, AiToolRegistry exposes the output schema via\nAuditedToolCallback and injects sessionId only when the schema declares it,\nand WorkflowService.compile now validates nested workflow input contracts.\n\nFlow hardening in AgentRunner: pinned failure envelopes fail the step\ninstead of masquerading as completed, template references are validated\nagainst declared output paths at plan time, and a skipped producer now\ncascades through implicit template dependencies. WorkflowExecutionService\nreturns the last actually-completed branch result to AI callers.\n\nEmail plugin: preparing a send is now a WRITE (non-idempotent) effect,\nconfirm_send success reflects the real delivery status, node labels\nclarify prepare vs execute, and a GreenMail test proves attachments only\ngo out after confirmation. Frontend FlowRunDialog delegates workbook\nanalysis to a testable workbookAnalysis module with stale-request\nguarding; excel execute test asserts real output files.","tree":{"sha":"ead48d9a1bb6ba060fa85f4ea2082e60d61c3a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/trees/ead48d9a1bb6ba060fa85f4ea2082e60d61c3a26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/git/commits/8ef8901524e521b92489ff7ef8d7e7a7df1a897d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/138420547?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark","id":138420547,"login":"MuskStark","node_id":"U_kgDOCEAhQw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MuskStark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/8ef8901524e521b92489ff7ef8d7e7a7df1a897d","node_id":"C_kwDORYbX49oAKDhlZjg5MDE1MjRlNTIxYjkyNDg5ZmY3ZWY4ZDdlN2E3ZGYxYTg5N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MuskStark/FengYu/commit/2b2cc6772caedc88577f2bc12ca44f53963433db","sha":"2b2cc6772caedc88577f2bc12ca44f53963433db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/commits/2b2cc6772caedc88577f2bc12ca44f53963433db"}],"sha":"8ef8901524e521b92489ff7ef8d7e7a7df1a897d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MuskStark/FengYu/co