 ratio information.\n- Refactored custom dimensions input to show only for ''custom'' preset.\n- Combined fit mode and background color settings into a single display settings card.\n\nfeat: enhance ExportNode with lightbox functionality and improved UI\n\n- Added lightbox feature for image/video previews in ExportNode.\n- Improved thumbnail display with hover effects and format badges.\n- Refactored share actions with copy URL functionality and visual feedback.\n\nfeat: enhance PreviewNode with lightbox and aspect ratio display\n\n- Implemented lightbox for image previews in PreviewNode.\n- Improved aspect ratio handling and thumbnail sizing.\n- Added preset badge display for better user feedback.\n\nfeat: create NodeImagePreview component for reusable image preview\n\n- Introduced NodeImagePreview component for consistent image display with lightbox functionality.\n\nfix: improve font sampling in fingerprint utility\n\n- Reformatted font list for better readability in fingerprint utility.\n\nchore: update docker-compose with daily budget environment variables\n\n- Added environment variables for daily budget limits for video, image, text, and pipeline.","tree":{"sha":"816c30c2bf0378c3d7fcd2835d1b5326faa27897","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yandiaan/adis-ai/git/trees/816c30c2bf0378c3d7fcd2835d1b5326faa27897"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yandiaan/adis-ai/git/commits/a980cbae7a19639544f0112c7d1a21c9682ab009","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39780760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yandiaan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yandiaan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yandiaan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yandiaan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yandiaan","id":39780760,"login":"yandi