228a6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/411dcfc7bad99761b25f32eab6c3b16e90c2cc92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T03:20:02Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T03:20:02Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"fix: remove systemctl enable for Quadlet transient unit\n\nQuadlet-generated services in /run/systemd/generator/ are transient\nand cannot be enabled via systemctl enable. The WantedBy directive\nin the .container file is handled automatically by the generator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff378467e76abaddcb46ee0a85d3c4754abecdd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/ff378467e76abaddcb46ee0a85d3c4754abecdd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/411dcfc7bad99761b25f32eab6c3b16e90c2cc92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/411dcfc7bad99761b25f32eab6c3b16e90c2cc92","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDQxMWRjZmM3YmFkOTk3NjFiMjVmMzJlYWI2YzNiMTZlOTBjMmNjOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c","sha":"842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c"}],"sha":"411dcfc7bad99761b25f32eab6c3b16e90c2cc92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/411dcfc7bad99761b25f32eab6c3b16e90c2cc92"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T03:16:58Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T03:16:58Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"fix: correct api.env.example — DB is on separate host, not host-gateway\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cae34fc6a89dfd983d27692ea310d37e6c74a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/0cae34fc6a89dfd983d27692ea310d37e6c74a58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDg0MmJjZGY4MWM3NWI2NjhjMTExOTMzZWQ2MTM1NGI0MmYzYjFkNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/7ca12b63e2e996db3b8ebc9d5e5c1c9b90647b25","sha":"7ca12b63e2e996db3b8ebc9d5e5c1c9b90647b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/7ca12b63e2e996db3b8ebc9d5e5c1c9b90647b25"}],"sha":"842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/842bcdf81c75b668c111933ed61354b42f3b1d6c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/7ca12b63e2e996db3b8ebc9d5e5c1c9b90647b25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-03T03:03:45Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-03T03:03:45Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"docs: record infrastructure topology and CI/CD flow\n\n- PostgreSQL runs on a separate Linux host (not API server)\n- CI builds and pushes image to ghcr.io; Linux server only pulls\n- DATABASE_DSN points directly to DB server IP (not host-gateway)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40cff91e064569dba99dc2838d0945dbca30e07d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/