865fb4b6bdcfcc70620d1632c155af1abd5711/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T06:34:14Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T06:34:14Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"ci: add GitHub Actions build pipeline + migrate-in-image\n\n- .github/workflows/build.yml: build & push to ghcr.io/robert7528/hyadmin-api on push to main\n- Containerfile: build hyadmin-migrate binary + copy migrations/ into image\n- deployment/entrypoint.sh: auto-migrate then serve on container start\n- deployment/hyadmin-api.container: switch Image to ghcr.io\n- deployment/deploy.sh: replace podman build with podman pull (no Go needed on host)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70bb093c8e44a6a5e8ff481e82d18d17acbd02fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/70bb093c8e44a6a5e8ff481e82d18d17acbd02fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/5e865fb4b6bdcfcc70620d1632c155af1abd5711","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/5e865fb4b6bdcfcc70620d1632c155af1abd5711","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDVlODY1ZmI0YjZiZGNmY2M3MDYyMGQxNjMyYzE1NWFmMWFiZDU3MTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/09164fff67f5048956e8d93f8e027b22fa4bd456","sha":"09164fff67f5048956e8d93f8e027b22fa4bd456","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/09164fff67f5048956e8d93f8e027b22fa4bd456"}],"sha":"5e865fb4b6bdcfcc70620d1632c155af1abd5711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/5e865fb4b6bdcfcc70620d1632c155af1abd5711"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/09164fff67f5048956e8d93f8e027b22fa4bd456/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T06:17:46Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T06:17:46Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"feat: implement Module/Feature/RBAC management system (Phase A-F)\n\n## Backend\n- Auth: pluggable Provider interface (LocalProvider + JWT service/handler)\n- Crypto: Google Tink AES-GCM encryptor for PII fields (NOP fallback in dev)\n- Casbin: GORM adapter enforcer with rbac_model.conf (wildcard + ABAC-ready)\n- AdminUser: CRUD with Tink-encrypted DisplayName/Email\n- PlatformModule: DB-backed (replaces in-memory registry), menu filtering via permission codes\n- Feature: per-module feature definitions\n- Permission: code-based (module.feature.action), types: menu/button/api, batch create from templates\n- Role: CRUD + Casbin-managed user↔role↔permission assignments\n- AuditLog: auto-record POST/PUT/DELETE via middleware; list API with filters\n- Config: JWTConfig + TinkConfig added\n- Tenant: InfraType/InfraConfig fields added for hyinfra future use\n- Middleware: real JWT AuthMiddleware, PermissionLoaderMiddleware, PermissionMiddleware\n- Server: full route restructure (public/protected/admin groups)\n- App: fx wiring for all new domains\n- Atlas loader: all new models registered\n- go.mod: jwt/v5, golang.org/x/crypto, casbin/v2, gorm-adapter/v3, tink-go/v2\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b6eadbc3950508fc72ee1bcaf0307685224e68ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/b6eadbc3950508fc72ee1bcaf0307685224e68ac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/09164fff67f5048956e8d93f8e027b22fa4bd456","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/09164fff67f5048956e8d93f8e027b22fa4bd456","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDA5MTY0ZmZmNjdmNTA0ODk1NmU4ZDkzZjhlMDI3YjIyZmE0YmQ0NTY","parents":[{"html_url":