yadmin-api/commit/991245d5a60206f8e9e5e27710fe39e0e1472cdd","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDk5MTI0NWQ1YTYwMjA2ZjhlOWU1ZTI3NzEwZmUzOWUwZTE0NzJjZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0","sha":"e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0"}],"sha":"991245d5a60206f8e9e5e27710fe39e0e1472cdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/991245d5a60206f8e9e5e27710fe39e0e1472cdd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:49:44Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:49:44Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"Integrate Atlas for database version control\n\n- atlas.hcl: local/prod env config (admin DB, tenant migrations dir)\n- internal/database/loader/main.go: GORM model schema loader for Atlas CLI\n- internal/database/migrate.go: Atlas programmatic runner (MigrateAdmin,\n  MigrateTenant with search_path support for schema mode)\n- internal/database/database.go: remove AutoMigrate (managed by Atlas)\n- cmd/migrate/main.go: Cobra CLI with admin / tenant / all-tenants subcommands\n- migrations/admin/, migrations/tenant/: versioned SQL migration dirs\n- deployment/deploy.sh: add Atlas CLI install + migrate admin before build\n- go.mod: add ariga.io/atlas v0.19.1 + atlas-provider-gorm v0.4.0\n- Run `go mod tidy` on Linux after pull\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ce093dc525ac2cd67c2eca36d4d3561a0c39248","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/1ce093dc525ac2cd67c2eca36d4d3561a0c39248"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKGU2OWY3MjExOGJiNmI5MTNkZThhZjU1NDlkOWI0N2YwNTY0NmExZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da","sha":"2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da"}],"sha":"e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/e69f72118bb6b913de8af5549d9b47f05646a1f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:38:00Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:38:00Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"Implement multi-tenant DB connection with GORM + dbresolver\n\n- TenantDBConfig model: per-tenant DB settings (mode: database|schema,\n  primary DSN, replica DSNs JSON, schema name) stored in admin DB\n- DBManager: lazy-load + cache *gorm.DB per tenant; dbresolver registers\n  replicas for read/write separation; InvalidateCache for config updates\n- withSearchPath: auto-appends search_path to DSN for schema mode\n  (supports both postgres:// URL and libpq key=value formats)\n- TenantDBMiddleware: resolves tenant DB from DBManager, injects into\n  gin context; GetTenantDB(c) helper for handlers\n- /api/v1/data group pre-wired with TenantDBMiddleware\n- go.mod: add gorm.io/plugin/dbresolver v1.5.3\n- Run `go mod tidy` on Linux after pull\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"252aeead7a23f82ee1f2322281ab7b6f477b3708","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/252aeead7a23f82ee1f2322281ab7b6f477b3708"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDJmOTZiYWNhZjkwZTc5ZDA1MTNhYTI2MTAwZTJlMzU2ZjZhMzU4ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4","sha":"e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4"}],"sha":"2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/2f96bacaf90e79d0513aa26100e2e356f6a358da"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:32:22Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:32:22Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"Add Podman deployment config\n\n- deployment/hyadmin-api.container: Quadlet file (systemctl管理)\n- deployment/api.env.example: DB/config env template (/etc/hyadmin/api.env)\n- deployment/deploy.sh: build image + install quadlet + restart service\n- config: SetEnvKeyReplacer for DATABASE_DSN / SERVER_PORT env override\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db57201b5be375c43501af3f2ff636a6e0954de3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/db57201b5be375c43501af3f2ff636a6e0954de3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKGUyNGRiMDcxZjkxMGFiNTUwYmExNzVhOGUyMGEwZDBhODZhYzQ2YTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/558235eed728dbc4833773ce866cb8cba10e0db5","sha":"558235eed728dbc4833773ce866cb8cba10e0db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/558235eed728dbc4833773ce866cb8cba10e0db5"}],"sha":"e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/e24db071f910ab550ba175a8e20a0d0a86ac46a4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commits/558235eed728dbc4833773ce866cb8cba10e0db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:04:10Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:04:10Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"Initial scaffold: hyadmin-api Go backend\n\n- uber-go/fx DI, Gin HTTP, Cobra/Viper config, zap logging\n- Tenant CRUD (GORM + PostgreSQL)\n- Module registry (GET /api/v1/modules for micro-frontend discovery)\n- Health check endpoint\n- X-Tenant-ID middleware, auth stub, panic recovery\n- Containerfile + compose.yaml (Podman/Docker)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"465f04a52e2ff61359421351a36b614c41f4457e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/trees/465f04a52e2ff61359421351a36b614c41f4457e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-api/git/commits/558235eed728dbc4833773ce866cb8cba10e0db5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-api/commit/558235eed728dbc4833773ce866cb8cba10e0db5","node_id":"C_kwDORYfY-toAKDU1ODIzNWVlZDcyOGRiYzQ4MzM3NzNj