mitter":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:50:39Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"refactor: remove cert module (moved to hycert-ui micro-app)\n\nCertificate toolbox components, API client, and i18n keys have been\nextracted to the standalone hycert-ui repo. The cert module will now\nbe loaded as a micro-app via <micro-app> element.\n\nRemoved:\n- src/components/cert/ (cert-router, cert-list, toolbox)\n- src/lib/cert-api.ts\n- cert_toolbox i18n keys from en.ts and zh-TW.ts\n- nativeModules map from [...route]/page.tsx\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24eff405c62b43ffb2cc16a2481a80f3b4144593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/git/trees/24eff405c62b43ffb2cc16a2481a80f3b4144593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/git/commits/3dfd6e2df03c044e7f140726208e621a9f70d15e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commit/3dfd6e2df03c044e7f140726208e621a9f70d15e","node_id":"C_kwDORYfazNoAKDNkZmQ2ZTJkZjAzYzA0NGU3ZjE0MDcyNjIwOGU2MjFhOWY3MGQxNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commit/65b41710f41d60ad026ceb6bc284d76741f9ea1f","sha":"65b41710f41d60ad026ceb6bc284d76741f9ea1f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/65b41710f41d60ad026ceb6bc284d76741f9ea1f"}],"sha":"3dfd6e2df03c044e7f140726208e621a9f70d15e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/3dfd6e2df03c044e7f140726208e621a9f70d15e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/65b41710f41d60ad026ceb6bc284d76741f9ea1f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:16:03Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:16:03Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"feat: add JKS/P7B forma