config and basePath\n\n- next.config.ts: basePath=''/hyadmin'' for nginx subpath deployment\n- deployment/nginx-hyadmin-ui.conf: proxy /hyadmin/ → port 3000\n- deployment/hyadmin-ui.service: systemd (standalone server.js)\n- deployment/deploy.sh: full deploy script (bun install/build + service)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"882a05b3791650d5429d4c76bfcc001e9ca8bdde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/git/trees/882a05b3791650d5429d4c76bfcc001e9ca8bdde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/git/commits/15ccb4f991f15dd0769cf1dbf27df3531ae47f84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commit/15ccb4f991f15dd0769cf1dbf27df3531ae47f84","node_id":"C_kwDORYfazNoAKDE1Y2NiNGY5OTFmMTVkZDA3NjljZjFkYmYyN2RmMzUzMWFlNDdmODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commit/6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705","sha":"6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705"}],"sha":"15ccb4f991f15dd0769cf1dbf27df3531ae47f84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/15ccb4f991f15dd0769cf1dbf27df3531ae47f84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:12:46Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-25T10:12:46Z","email":"robert@hyweb.com.tw","name":"K00"},"message":"Initial scaffold: hyadmin-ui Next.js Admin Shell\n\n- Next.js 15 App Router + React 19 + TypeScript\n- HeroUI shell layout (Header + Sidebar + Footer)\n- Sidebar dynamically fetches modules from hyadmin-api\n- micro-app container for micro-frontend sub-applications\n- Dynamic route /app/[...route] for module loading\n- Shadcn/ui config + Tailwind CSS + HeroUI provider\n- Containerfile (Bun builder + Node runner) + compose.yaml\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"af504189dcc9e1ffd5b93e7a46accfe3e6b92536","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/git/trees/af504189dcc9e1ffd5b93e7a46accfe3e6b92536"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/git/commits/6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commit/6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705","node_id":"C_kwDORYfazNoAKDZlMGJiN2Q3MzVmNGFjNTRiZmEyM2Q4Mjc1MjliOWQ4YWYxZmI3MDU","parents":[],"sha":"6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits/6e0bb7d735f4ac54bfa23d827529b9d8af1fb705"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/robert7528/hyadmin-ui/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=1543c765d81034dc5317ffd9671e42057f59446e&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A27%3A20.241Z"}');
