LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"message":"ci: fail a non-main Render dispatch loudly instead of skipping it\n\nA job-level `if:` shows a dispatch from the wrong branch as \"skipped\",\nand once `dev` is the default the Run workflow picker preselects it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3a4384b0b79fb9b7b885156178cfb429d4bf1d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/a3a4384b0b79fb9b7b885156178cfb429d4bf1d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/4ca75334ecfa2c36d524bf040b25ed9eb3f68919","verification":{"payload":"tree a3a4384b0b79fb9b7b885156178cfb429d4bf1d5\nparent 64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40\nauthor LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1789562047 +0300\ncommitter LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1789562142 +0300\n\nci: fail a non-main Render dispatch loudly instead of skipping it\n\nA job-level `if:` shows a dispatch from the wrong branch as \"skipped\",\nand once `dev` is the default the Run workflow picker preselects it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg65RgOXaobIWmShxVbQxxdrUES+\nprdck9i5CvM2zvHV4AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQG5YsRxb9xCvI4zC5NEgCYxbZJVI2mkkKwkaRZCvPs2p+19GywK1R4MKkvSi+l161K\niY0LSUO3cZQ/rXtPlvTQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T12:35:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/4ca75334ecfa2c36d524bf040b25ed9eb3f68919","node_id":"C_kwDORYlqjNoAKDRjYTc1MzM0ZWNmYTJjMzZkNTI0YmYwNDBiMjVlZDllYjNmNjg5MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40","sha":"64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40"}],"sha":"4ca75334ecfa2c36d524bf040b25ed9eb3f68919","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/4ca75334ecfa2c36d524bf040b25ed9eb3f68919"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:32:26Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:32:26Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"message":"ci: make deploy-render manual-only, gated on a green backend run\n\ndeploy-render triggered on `workflow_run`, which GitHub reads from the\ndefault branch''s copy. It was dormant while `main` was the default (main\nhas no copy) and would start auto-deploying every green push to `main`\nthe moment `dev` becomes the default. Staging deploys are manual (#329),\nso Render is too.\n\nThe suite gate that `workflow_run` provided becomes an explicit first\nstep: the dispatched commit must have a successful `backend` push run,\nor nothing is deployed. The deploy stays pinned to that commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2cf5320c41d69291321b3df0efd1438675ef20ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/2cf5320c41d69291321b3df0efd1438675ef20ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40","verification":{"payload":"tree 2cf5320c41d69291321b3df0efd1438675ef20ab\nparent fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8\nauthor LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561946 +0300\ncommitter LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561946 +0300\n\nci: make deploy-render manual-only, gated on a green backend run\n\ndeploy-render triggered on `workflow_run`, which GitHub reads from the\ndefault branch''s copy. It was dormant while `main` was the default (main\nhas no copy) and would start auto-deploying every green push to `main`\nthe moment `dev` becomes the default. Staging deploys are manual (#329),\nso Render is too.\n\nThe suite gate that `workflow_run` provided becomes an explicit first\nstep: the dispatched commit must have a successful `backend` push run,\nor nothing is deployed. The deploy stays pinned to that commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg65RgOXaobIWmShxVbQxxdrUES+\nprdck9i5CvM2zvHV4AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNr7ndAakfBeNDGI0ZE+TYIxR08e/IVGYejm0Y/XVBvbapagZhZwG4eH904SKO895n\nXeiP5gy2FQwMkOS4FNrQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T12:35:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40","node_id":"C_kwDORYlqjNoAKDY0ZmZhMmUzNDBhZmJiNmZjYTc3YzQzNGFlMzNiOWFjYTY4NWNhNDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8","sha":"fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8"}],"sha":"64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/64ffa2e340afbb6fca77c434ae33b9aca685ca40"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:07:23Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:18:04Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"message":"ci: gate deploy-staging to manual dispatch only (#143) (#329)\n\nEXACT staging is deployed manually (build image → terraform apply → Secret\nManager → exact-staging-migrate job), not from CI. Remove the stray\npush:branches:[main] trigger so a merge to main no longer kicks off an\nunintended staging deploy; workflow_dispatch keeps it manually runnable.\n\nFreshened off current main (replaces the stale #143 branch, 264 commits behind).\nVerified: main has no branch protection (deploy-staging isn''t a required check),\nno workflow chains off it, github.sha resolves under workflow_dispatch.\nReviewed: codex + fresh-context subagent.\n\nCo-authored-by: Leonid Morozov <lmmobi98@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit d3d3cb39bea0fbae2598275e7ab9ceb78fd0a613)","tree":{"sha":"9512cdbcee5adfd406a77278f6d3b915d43fdfa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/9512cdbcee5adfd406a77278f6d3b915d43fdfa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8","verification":{"payload":"tree 9512cdbcee5adfd406a77278f6d3b915d43fdfa3\nparent 43a031f8fe624aa8d6c6d9f8d2e862b64c4cc108\nauthor LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1787497643 +0300\ncommitter LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561084 +0300\n\nci: gate deploy-staging to manual dispatch only (#143) (#329)\n\nEXACT staging is deployed manually (build image → terraform apply → Secret\nManager → exact-staging-migrate job), not from CI. Remove the stray\npush:branches:[main] trigger so a merge to main no longer kicks off an\nunintended staging deploy; workflow_dispatch keeps it manually runnable.\n\nFreshened off current main (replaces the stale #143 branch, 264 commits behind).\nVerified: main has no branch protection (deploy-staging isn''t a required check),\nno workflow chains off it, github.sha resolves under workflow_dispatch.\nReviewed: codex + fresh-context subagent.\n\nCo-authored-by: Leonid Morozov <lmmobi98@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit d3d3cb39bea0fbae2598275e7ab9ceb78fd0a613)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg65RgOXaobIWmShxVbQxxdrUES+\nprdck9i5CvM2zvHV4AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHOHjCKEZKcIZWjiTvFzB/2vC0OopGQwgwgSU9wQKMvMlmKWMNn+wBmHDNwdGktXED\nvWPNp/JnwV0q3ZFXw00gs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T12:20:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8","node_id":"C_kwDORYlqjNoAKGZiNzA4ZWM0ZmUyNmIyYmJlYTE2MDZhZTJmOWNkNDA4YmVjY2VkYzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/43a031f8fe624aa8d6c6d9f8d2e862b64c4cc108","sha":"43a031f8fe624aa8d6c6d9f8d2e862b64c4cc108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/43a031f8fe624aa8d6c6d9f8d2e862b64c4cc108"}],"sha":"fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/fb708ec4fe26b2bbea1606ae2f9cd408beccedc8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69346755?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeoMo42","id":69346755,"login":"LeoMo42","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MzQ2NzU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeoMo42","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/43a031f8fe624aa8d6c6d9f8d2e862b64c4cc108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-23T15:06:44Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:18:04Z","email":"69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com","name":"LeoMo42"},"message":"ci: gate the :latest image tag on pushes to main only (#378)\n\n`enable={{is_default_branch}}` reads as \"only main\", but docker/metadata-action\ncounts a tag push as coming from the default branch. Harmless while every tag\nwas cut from main; not harmless once a tag is cut from a deployment branch that\nnever merges into main — that tag build republishes :latest pointing at it.\n\nThat happened with harvard-2026-08-14: the tag build emitted\n\n    naming to docker.io/***:harvard-2026-08-14\n    naming to docker.io/***:sha-e3d78575af9d816ecab4fce2df2fa65bce8f3979\n    naming to docker.io/***:latest\n\nand :latest served the Harvard image (no ?therapy_id=, CB marker models, three\nmodels dropped) until main''s build was re-run to restore it.\n\nTags keep their own immutable tag plus the long-sha tag — what a deployment\nshould pin anyway.\n\nCo-authored-by: Leonid Morozov <lmmobi98@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit b59d4e590ee38c45cf35a7b6a1d33319c02e363f)","tree":{"sha":"bbe6fe8849e9b137a3b6dc0c5763f92ad357b45e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/bbe6fe8849e9b137a3b6dc0c5763f92ad357b45e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/43a031f8fe624aa8d6c6d9f8d2e862b64c4cc108","verification":{"payload":"tree bbe6fe8849e9b137a3b6dc0c5763f92ad357b45e\nparent 7b6e64dd6ca61b07e9509f4e4bb2e8665a33289d\nauthor LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1787497604 +0300\ncommitter LeoMo42 <69346755+LeoMo42@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561084 +0300\n\nci: gate the :latest image tag on pushes to main only (#378)\n\n`enable={{is_default_branch}}` reads as \"only main\", but docker/metadata-action\ncounts a tag push as coming from the default branch. Harmless while every tag\nwas cut from main; not harmless once a tag is cut from a deployment branch that\nnever merges into main — that tag build republishes :latest pointing at it.\n\nThat happened with harvard-2026-08-14: the tag build emitted\n\n    naming to docker.io/***:harvard-2026-08-14\n    naming to docker.io/***:sha-e3d78575af9d816ecab4fce2df2fa65bce8f3979\n    naming to docker.io/***:latest\n\nand :latest served the Harvard image (no ?therapy_id=, CB marker models, three\nmodels dropped) until main''s build was re-run to restore it.\n\nTags keep their own immutable tag plus the long-sha tag — what a deployment\nshould pin anyway.\n\nCo-authored-by: Leonid Morozov <lmmobi98@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit b59d4e590ee38c45cf35a7b6a1d33319c02e363f)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg65RgOXaobIWmShxVbQxxdrUES+\nprdck9i5CvM2zvHV4AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL7ThNyG0TP1dt/nZZAWyAQ1f7ZlXTZmhENqjNs7ig7m/389yT+qFylaq1Scn3S9L4\nvw+SfUssRctG8VkAbfpww=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-1