Morozov","id":2562446,"login":"LeonidMorozov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjI0NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/c83e4bd0e19ff9688e3676c70fcc95df6507f6bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T15:42:15Z","email":"lmmobi98@gmail.com","name":"Leonid Morozov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T15:42:15Z","email":"lmmobi98@gmail.com","name":"Leonid Morozov"},"message":"ci: repair broken toolcache pip via ensurepip + evict poisoned python cache\n\nNew CI failure mode on fresh runners: the cached/toolcache pip is a broken\n24.1+ mix where importing pip itself raises\n`ImportError: cannot import name ''get_runnable_pip''`, so even the existing\n`pip install \"pip<24.1\"` pin can''t run (fails at import before downgrading).\n\nFix:\n- `python -m ensurepip --upgrade` first — stdlib bootstrap that lays down a\n  coherent bundled pip without importing the broken one, then the existing\n  pin to <24.1 runs and requirements install cleanly.\n- Bump the `${{ env.pythonLocation }}` cache key v1->v2 (both build+test\n  jobs) to evict the poisoned python cache that captured the broken pip.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e52c7cfe3e213ae0b33632e319a97160ebd00c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/7e52c7cfe3e213ae0b33632e319a97160ebd00c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/c83e4bd0e19ff9688e3676c70fcc95df6507f6bb","verification":{"payload