4YTlmZmM3YWIxOTZmMTU0NjZiMTBlY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/c6b30c6c64bbb210f49b8f7c28292ff663d7a08e","sha":"c6b30c6c64bbb210f49b8f7c28292ff663d7a08e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/c6b30c6c64bbb210f49b8f7c28292ff663d7a08e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/healthkey-ai/exact/commit/1a5254b38f1fa4cec158de42713303ecdb520f96","sha":"1a5254b38f1fa4cec158de42713303ecdb520f96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/1a5254b38f1fa4cec158de42713303ecdb520f96"}],"sha":"891a6d72613efc4f8a9ffc7ab196f15466b10ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/891a6d72613efc4f8a9ffc7ab196f15466b10ecf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2562446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeonidMorozov","id":2562446,"login":"LeonidMorozov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjI0NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/1a5254b38f1fa4cec158de42713303ecdb520f96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T11:08:13Z","email":"lmmobi98@gmail.com","name":"Leonid Morozov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T11:08:13Z","email":"lmmobi98@gmail.com","name":"Leonid Morozov"},"message":"feat(mcl): remove metastatic_status as a matching attr (catch up to CB #4121)\n\nCB removed metastatic_status from trial-matching (redundant with stage /\ndistant_metastasis_stage, SME-confirmed #4121) but kept the data field. Port that\nto EXACT (git-history: EXACT only inherited it, never intentionally kept it; D5).\n\n- patient_info/configs.py: drop the `metastatic_status` USER_TO_TRIAL_ATTRS_MAPPING\n  entry (BC bool_restriction on metastatic_required), leaving the CB removal comment.\n- trial_details/configs.py: drop the 4 mirror refs (metastaticRequired list entry,\n  metastaticStatus/metastatic_status computed-source maps, metastaticRequired->disease).\n- Kept: the `metastatic_required` Trial column and the CTOMOP normalization that\n  populates PatientInfo.metastatic_status (still a data field, just not matched on).\n\nAlso removes a QR4d blocker (the pkg-only metastatic_status mapping key that broke\nCB<->pkg mapping-key equality).\n\nTests: regression that metastatic_status is not in the mapping (the CTOMOP\nnormalization tests confirm the field itself still works). Golden + MCL suites\ngreen (85, --create-db); disease-aware/value (26) + CTOMOP normalize (110) green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"abbc2ddd5740631bd811b4a64591944f0123a7ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/abbc2ddd5740631bd811b4a64591944f0123a7ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/1a5254b38f1fa4cec158de42713303ecdb520f96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2562446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/following{/o