wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeonidMorozov","id":2562446,"login":"LeonidMorozov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjI0NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/commits/305023854d844587dccfe85341ddb9943c87c8d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:17:02Z","email":"lmmobi98@gmail.com","name":"Leonid Morozov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T01:20:53Z","email":"lmmobi98@gmail.com","name":"Leonid Morozov"},"message":"feat(mcl): MIPI catch-up to CB — simplified-MIPI + tp53 p53_ihc\n\nPorts two CB MCL fixes into EXACT''s live matcher (dev), following #187/#189/#296.\nExcludes host-contract/schema items (WBC unit, per-lab LDH ULN) by design.\n\n- simplified-MIPI (CB #4421): new `mipi_simplified_risk` cached_property (a point\n  score distinct from the continuous MIPI — a patient can differ on each), emitted\n  as `high_mipi_simplified` in high_risk_mcl_criteria independently of high_mipi,\n  wired through HIGH_RISK_MCL_CRITERIA_SOURCES + _criteria_source_blank, and added\n  to the MCL vocab (load_mcl_options) so it can actually match trials.\n  Introduces a shared `_mipi_inputs()` helper (DRY) and refactors mipi_risk onto it\n  — behaviour-preserving (same CELLS/L fallback + fixed MIPI_LDH_ULN=250; EXACT has\n  no per-lab ULN field). Existing MIPI tests unchanged (53 still green).\n  ECOG contributes 0/2 points per the published Hoster sMIPI (not 3) — matches CB''s\n  SME-confirmed #4421 and the cutoff calibration (0-3 low / 4-5 int / >=6 high).\n- tp53_disruption: add the `p53_ihc >= 50%` trigger (CB) — was missing.\n\nTests: sMIPI bands + distinct-from-continuous + independent emission + None-guards;\ntp53 p53_ihc>=50. Derivation suite 65, MCL sweep green.\n\ndisease_code whitespace-tolerance was dropped from this bundle: stripping only in\ndisease_code (not _normalize_mcl_derivations) would make a padded MCL title match\nbut skip derivation — a follow-up will fix both sites together (codex P2).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"999a03c5329f65c0aa9fe3ef49c4ae0ef61e6c65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/trees/999a03c5329f65c0aa9fe3ef49c4ae0ef61e6c65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/healthkey-ai/exact/git/commits/305023854d844587dccfe85341ddb9943c87c8d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2562446?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LeonidMorozov","id":2562446,"login":"LeonidMorozov","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjI0NDY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LeonidMorozov/subscriptions","typ