:"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/959483724518ada320021ce91f6e84f66dedb4f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T19:53:56Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T19:53:56Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"Fix verified findings: CSV parser, double DONE, dead code, memory cap\n\n- Guard post-loop DONE dispatch with streamingRef check to prevent\n  double-dispatch and wrong semantics after RUN_ERROR\n- Replace naive CSV split(\",\") with quote-aware parser that handles\n  commas inside quoted fields (e.g. \"Acme, Inc.\")\n- Remove RichPreview component with hardcoded fake data (\"84% Confidence\",\n  \"Compliance Active\") that was not derived from actual file content\n- Remove dead DocumentsDrawer (rendered but never opened — setDocumentsOpen\n  was never called)\n- Cap _deleted_sessions set at 10K with eviction to prevent unbounded\n  memory growth in long-running orchestrator\n- Replace stale hardcoded \"v1.0.4-release\" version string\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b8de673f5d1faef6728f95e69486aaefc5ff1d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/6b8de673f5d1faef6728f95e69486aaefc5ff1d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/9