commits/2b325ad198a9c2a6fe0b39c3503ed932033db5b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T18:20:59Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T18:20:59Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"Harden stability across session lifecycle, SSE streaming, and frontend\n\nFindings from 4-agent audit team. All 21 Playwright tests pass.\n\nBackend:\n- Fix delete_session() early return: bookkeeping now runs before\n  best-effort container reset, so sessions are always cleaned up\n- deploy.sh: fix stale defaults (eastus2→eastus, gpt-5-codex→gpt-4.1,\n  -search→-srch), fix duplicate step numbering\n\nFrontend:\n- Add 120s client-side inactivity timeout on SSE streaming to prevent\n  indefinite UI hangs when server stops sending\n- Harden SSE parser to accept both \"data: \" and \"data:\" (SSE spec)\n- Surface chat upload errors to user instead of swallowing silently\n- Add timeouts to listFiles (15s) and getFileContent (30s) API calls\n- Add timeout to session restore check to handle dead sessions\n- Guard rapid sends with ref to prevent stale-closure race condition\n- Fix filesLoading: use isInitializing instead of empty array check\n\nTests:\n- Increase navigateToChatViaIntake retries to 25 with longer waits\n- Increase artifact debug streaming timeout to 280s\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0db837b6aa0eb6eec6e3198d82e88b78d0626f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/d0db837b6aa0eb6eec6e3198d82e88b78d0626f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/2b325ad198a9c2a6fe0b39c3503ed932033db5b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/2b325ad198a9c2a6fe0b39c3503ed932033db5b0","node_id":"C_kwDORYpB6doAKDJiMzI1YWQxOThhOWMyYTZmZTBiMzljMzUwM2VkOTMyMDMzZGI1YjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89","sha":"a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89"}],"sha":"2b325ad198a9c2a6fe0b39c3503ed932033db5b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/2b325ad198a9c2a6fe0b39c3503ed932033db5b0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T16:47:13Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T16:47:13Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"Fix post-migration Azure OpenAI connectivity and test reliability\n\n- Switch Copilot SDK provider from \"openai\" to \"azure\" with api_version\n  so the CLI constructs correct Azure endpoint URLs\n- Keep wire_api as \"chat\" (not \"responses\") for gpt-4.1 compatibility\n- Add 30s timeout on session creation health check to fail fast on pool\n  exhaustion instead of hanging\n- Reorder Playwright projects: visual → debug → comprehensive to reduce\n  pool pressure on sensitive tests\n- Increase createSessionViaAPI retries to 35 (handles 300s cooldown)\n- Add browser session cleanup (afterEach + cleanupBrowserSession) to\n  free pool slots between tests\n- Increase Journey 4 test timeouts to 600s for multi-session scenarios\n- Remove --reload from dev.py uvicorn (avoids restart loops)\n- Default WORKSPACE to project-relative path for local dev\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d131d91d4d27d15a837fae0519e7933ad380f35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/8d131d91d4d27d15a837fae0519e7933ad380f35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89","node_id":"C_kwDORYpB6doAKGE4YTczOGY3NjlkYzhjYzlkOWU5YzNmZjAyYmUzZDk3ZmI1NzRjODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/32264c100eec0405951d7d41dbbc5273b6ec28e6","sha":"32264c100eec0405951d7d41dbbc5273b6ec28e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/32264c100eec0405951d7d41dbbc5273b6ec28e6"}],"sha":"a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/a8a738f769dc8cc9d9e9c3ff02be3d97fb574c89"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_ur