sing tracing.py\n\n- Tighten CORS: explicit methods/headers instead of wildcards\n- Add security headers middleware (X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy)\n- Add prompt validation (min_length=1, max_length=50000) on both orchestrator and session container\n- Remove .html/.htm from allowed upload extensions (XSS risk)\n- Sanitize error details returned to clients (no raw upstream text)\n- Fix lock race condition: move error handlers inside async with _lock\n- Fix Dockerfile: add tracing.py to COPY (was causing container crash at import time)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3842c29e524f546767d6e333085640f54d88f74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/a3842c29e524f546767d6e333085640f54d88f74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/74baa2c499aa8cf5e6e29e82034949d42177ecd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public