padding-left + list-style to ol/ul/li (was completely broken by Tailwind reset)\n- Table min-width: 520px (prevents 5th column clipping in narrow layouts)\n- prose-message h2: font-weight 600 → 700 (stronger hierarchy vs h3)\n- Add .canvas-content utility class for max-width centering\n\nChat.tsx:\n- Chat column: w-[360px] when canvas open (was 420px) — canvas gets more space\n- Remove dark linear-gradient overlay (was making content darker than sidebars)\n- Status pill border: white/12 → white/20 (visible)\n- New chat button: add hover:bg-brand/15 hover:border-brand/55\n- Suggestion chips: disabled during isInitializing (prevents dropped messages)\n\nMessageBubble.tsx:\n- Tool group collapse threshold: parts.length > 2 → > 1 (groups of 2 now collapsible)\n- Add write_file + create_file to toolContext switch (shows filename in chip)\n- Add create_file labels to toolLabelForStatus\n\nArtifactsPanel.tsx:\n- Section icons: remove bg-white/[0.06] wrapper containers, use 15px bare SVGs\n- Sidebar bg: black/25 → black/30 (slightly more distinct from content)\n- Deliverables empty state: ghost bolt icon + softer text\n\nDocumentsList.tsx:\n- File item borders: white/8 → white/[0.12] (visible containment)\n- Empty state border: white/10 → white/[0.12]\n\nArtifactCanvas.tsx:\n- bg-[#0d1018] → bg-[#10151f] (lighter than sidebar, canvas feels like workspace)\n- Header border: white/10 → white/[0.15]\n- Extension badge: more opaque bg + muted-strong text\n- Markdown article: max-w-[68ch] mx-auto (comfortable reading line length)\n\nIntakeScreen.tsx:\n- Mobile centering: items-center on all sizes (removes dead black space below card)\n- Gradient: centered at 50% x-axis, opacity .15 → .20\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e1fb84f0ab1e2ac99be56452c774d427306a9c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/0e1fb84f0ab1e2ac99be56452c774d427306a9c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/co