pi.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/8d9d14e2d779118c92ea859711165f2f1daa4ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T20:32:33Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T20:32:33Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"UX audit pass 2: premium polish across all surfaces\n\nCSS system:\n- Raise --app-muted to #c2ccd8 (WCAG AA fix), add surface tokens\n- Page-level radial aurora gradient (50% center, 12% opacity)\n- Heading scale: h1 1.5rem, h2 1.2rem, h3 1.05rem with letter-spacing\n- Paragraph margins 0.45→0.75em with first/last-child guards\n- Blockquote: stronger border (0.85), more padding, bg 0.11\n- Table: 0.875rem body, uppercase th headers, zebra rows, 0.9rem border-radius\n- message-parts gap 0.1→0.65rem (fixes tool chip/text fusion)\n- Shimmer: brighter (0.26), faster (0.95s), 90deg angle\n- Streaming cursor: ease-in-out blink (was step-end)\n- idle-breathe animation for empty state icon\n- Tool done color #a3b0c4, toggle hover bg, icon done #4ade80\n- prose-canvas: h3 1.0rem, body #e2eaff, h2 font-weight 650→600\n\nChat layout:\n- Header: \"MERIDIAN / Proposal Workspace\" branding\n- Logo gradient: remove cyan, use #5f92ff→#3a6fd8\n- Session pill: \"Agent active/Ready · N files\" (no session ID)\n- \"New chat\" button: brand-tinted glass\n- Header backdrop: bg-black/50 + inset shadow\n- Gradient: re-centered ellipse at 50% x-axis, 15% opacity\n- Canvas column: w-[420px]/lg:w-[460px] when open (was 500px)\n- Replace window.confirm() with branded inline modal\n\nIntake screen:\n- Headline: \"Win more contracts, faster.\"\n- Card: max-w-xl (was max-w-4xl), items-start on mobile\n- Drop zone: py-10/14 proportions, h-16 icon\n- Trust signals row: 4 badges (encrypted, sandbox, auto-delete, SOC 2)\n\nArtifactsPanel:\n- Renamed: \"My Documents\" / \"Deliverables\"\n- Sidebar: w-64 (was w-72), h-6 icon containers\n- \"Deliverables\" label: brand-strong/70 tint\n- Empty labels improved\n\nMessageList:\n- Heading: \"Your RFP is ready. Where do you want to start?\"\n- Suggestion descriptions: benefit-focused, second-person\n- Empty state icon: document-check (replaced bolt), idle-breathe\n- Chips: staggered fade-in, active:bg-brand/15, text-brand icons\n- Grid: grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2\n- Jump to latest: chevron icon + fade-in entrance\n\nInputBar:\n- Focus glow: border-brand/50 + ring-shadow on focus\n- Keyboard hint: ⏎ send (shows when focused+empty)\n- Stop button: active:bg-red-500/30\n- Send disabled: bg-white/12 (more visible)\n\nArtifactCanvas:\n- Remove \"CANVAS\" label, add extension badge on filename\n- Loading: shimmer skeleton (replaced text)\n- Download: checkmark feedback state\n- Canvas panel: max-w-[680px], bg-[#0d1018]\n\nDocumentsList:\n- Row: px-2.5 py-2.5, mt-1 metadata spacing\n- Filename: text-[13px], group-hover:text-white\n- Metadata: text-[11px], timestamp opacity /70\n- Chevron: /60 at rest, /80 hover\n- Skeleton: h-9→h-11\n- \"Open in canvas\" tooltip on hover\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"977e0f6135a8215bf5930bae91e805633dc0caec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/977e0f6135a8215bf5930bae91e805633dc0caec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/8d9d14e2d779118c92ea859711165f2f1daa4ee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":