e1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/72df9d03d25f1df6b67df7b57a85ca5b464cedf5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T20:18:42Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T20:18:42Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"UX audit pass 1: layout, design system, and component polish\n\n- Move artifacts panel to left, make canvas the focal point when open\n- Chat column shrinks to w-[500px] when canvas is open (flex-1 otherwise)\n- ArtifactCanvas fills remaining space (flex-1) at lg breakpoint\n- ArtifactsPanel visible at md breakpoint (was lg)\n- Deepen brand color (#4f85ff), fix muted contrast, raise body font minimum\n- Heading hierarchy in prose-message (h1/h2/h3 sizes)\n- Stop button: red tint styling; send button: brand blue\n- MessageBubble avatar: CPU chip icon replaces star\n- MessageList: larger empty state icon (h-20), text-xl heading, benefit-focused suggestion chips with descriptions\n- IntakeScreen: value-prop subtext, drag scale transform, prep animation\n- DocumentsList: whole-row clickable, neutral file icon, open .md version of converted uploads\n- Remove onAskFile / Ask button throughout\n- Animation speed-ups: cursor-blink 0.7s, thinking-dot 0.95s, agent-working 1.2s\n- Canvas prose: larger h1/h2, green tool-done state\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a295b7b2f10c77bd8abecde8371791a7db1b9f64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/a295b7b2f10c77bd8abecde8371791a7db1b9f64"},"url":"https://api.git