\n- Chat header: Remove \"Pursuit Copilot Workspace\" third line, replace\n  chat bubble icon with bolt icon\n- Replace Next.js N favicon with brand SVG bolt icon\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4adcbf274117eff2a4e9d86160c25b7ae0efdb1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/4adcbf274117eff2a4e9d86160c25b7ae0efdb1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/9120bef71ddd343ffdca482866ee7b464d9e8b4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/9120bef71ddd343ffdca482866ee7b464d9e8b4b","node_id":"C_kwDORYpB6doAKDkxMjBiZWY3MWRkZDM0M2ZmZGNhNDgyODY2ZWU3YjQ2NGQ5ZThiNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3","sha":"f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3"}],"sha":"9120bef71ddd343ffdca482866ee7b464d9e8b4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/9120bef71ddd343ffdca482866ee7b464d9e8b4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T13:31:06Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T13:31:06Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"Harden backend: CU timeout, upload-converts-inline, session ID validation\n\n- content_processing: Add 180s asyncio timeout on CU poller to prevent\n  hangs on large PDFs\n- session_manager: Require CU+ADLS (503 if missing), fail upload if\n  conversion fails instead of returning partial result, validate\n  session IDs with regex before probing health endpoint\n- session-container/server: Add async lock on upload manifest writes,\n  non-fatal manifest errors\n- session-container/agent: Remove convert_document MCP tool (conversion\n  now happens at upload time in orchestrator), simplify system prompt,\n  prefer md/CSV output over binary formats, tell agent when KB tool\n  is unavailable\n- frontend: Simplify upload states (remove \"processing\" phase since\n  upload+conversion is now one request), update api.ts return type\n- .gitignore: Exclude screenshots/ and sweep-results/ dev artifacts\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e1c8d45bd36d0b080ff1b4b9892bafefd60a06e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/1e1c8d45bd36d0b080ff1b4b9892bafefd60a06e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3","node_id":"C_kwDORYpB6doAKGY3ODQxOTNmMjY4N2MyZjAyNTEzNjBlZTE5YzZiNWNkYjkyYTRjZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commit/6905921de372cdd581c4bb3d8f7dc49835865ca6","sha":"6905921de372cdd581c4bb3d8f7dc49835865ca6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/6905921de372cdd581c4bb3d8f7dc49835865ca6"}],"sha":"f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/f784193f2687c2f0251360ee19c6b5cdb92a4cd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/commits/6905921de372cdd581c4bb3d8f7dc49835865ca6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-07T13:27:16Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-07T13:27:16Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"Inline interleaved tool calls in chat messages (Copilot-style UX)\n\nReplace the separate AgentActivityBar and top-of-message tool accordion\nwith inline tool indicators that appear between text segments as the\nagent works. Tool calls now render in the natural flow: text -> tool\ncard -> text -> tool card, matching GitHub Copilot and Claude Code UX.\n\nKey changes:\n- Add MessagePart union type (text | tool_call) and parts array to\n  ChatMessage for interleaved rendering\n- Track currentRunId in reducer so all events within a single agent run\n  stay in one message bubble (fixes split messages after tool calls)\n- Group consecutive tool calls into bordered cards with collapsible\n  toggle when >2 completed steps\n- Tool icons use green checkmark pills (done) or blue spinner pills\n  (running) with past/present tense labels\n- Context strings render in monospace code pills for visual separation\n- Slide-in animation on tool groups, \"Thinking...\" reappears after\n  tool calls while agent processes results\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b2fe084e83f0c23ffe7587bd8b5b33d3cb12b74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/9b2fe084e83f0c23ffe7587bd8b5b33d3cb12b74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/6905921de372cdd581c4bb3d8f7dc49835865ca6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/received_even