p-agent/commits/d1d0d17de76064af07504b5589993f5c2ae29595/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T19:46:32Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T19:46:32Z","email":"djgiannone92@gmail.com","name":"DanGiannone1"},"message":"Add Artifact Canvas, generated file detection, and tool context display\n\n- ArtifactCanvas: inline viewer for workspace files with markdown rendering,\n  copy/download actions, auto-opens newest generated artifact after agent turns\n- Upload manifest tracks file origin (uploaded vs generated) so the sidebar\n  correctly splits documents from agent-produced deliverables\n- /files/content endpoint serves text file content for canvas preview\n- Tool args forwarding: agent emits ToolCallArgsEvent, activity bar and tool\n  indicators show human-readable context (filename, query, command)\n- IntakeScreen: retry button only shows on error, not during normal preparation\n- Minor UI polish: step count labels, workspace search label\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4460de5766fd71c0918a4a62d9466890e30e7847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/trees/4460de5766fd71c0918a4a62d9466890e30e7847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DanGiannone1/rfp-agent/git/commits/d1d0d17de76064af07504b5589993f5c2ae29595","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104079707?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanGiannone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DanGiannone1","id":104079707,"login":"DanGiannone1","node_id":"U_kgDOBjQhWw","organiza