esh187@gmail.com","name":"Animesh Kumar"},"message":"fix(ui): hide an empty business date and explain why sign-in failed\n\nGET /businessdate answers [] when the business date feature is not\nconfigured, and the header then showed \"BUSINESS DATE: -\" for the whole\nsession. Leave the chip out when there is no business date.\n\nSign-in failures all ended as \"Login failed. Check credentials/server.\",\nor the platform''s \"Unauthenticated. Please login.\" for a wrong password.\nName the credentials for a refused username or password, point at the API\nendpoint for a 404, say the server could not be reached for a network or\nCORS failure, and keep the platform''s own message for other errors such\nas an unknown tenant.\n\nPart of #671","tree":{"sha":"e3d0a136d642507b38a6dc4ed7fd2baa6478b65d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/fineract-backoffice-ui/git/trees/e3d0a136d642507b38a6dc4ed7fd2baa6478b65d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/fineract-backoffice-ui/git/commits/036025a34e8c9d4ca5b7e98bd565e5fcdeff26c5","verification":{"payload":"tree e3d0a136d642507b38a6dc4ed7fd2baa6478b65d\nparent dafb9bf6b1db424dd71bbf95398053e0e250b9c5\nauthor Animesh Kumar <kanimesh187@gmail.com> 1791248060 +0530\ncommitter Animesh Kumar <kanimesh187@gmail.com> 1791248060 +0530\n\nfix(ui): hide an empty business date and explain why sign-in failed\n\nGET /businessdate answers [] when the business date feature is not\nconfigured, and the header then showed \"BUSINESS DATE: -\" for the whole\nsession. Leave the chip out when there is no business date.\n\nSign-in failures all ended as \"Login failed. Check credentials/server.\",\nor the platform''s \"Unauthenticated. Please login.\" for a wrong password.\nName the credentials for a refused username or password, point at the API\nendpoint for a 404, say the server could not be reached for a network or\nCORS failure, and keep the platform''s own message for other errors such\nas an unknown tenant.\n\nPart of #671\n","reason":"v