,"html_url":"https://github.com/my-Sitara","id":30214225,"login":"my-Sitara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMjE0MjI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/my-Sitara/artisan-base-frontend/commits/0b32ec969b363bda315df6569b894f52d3b7c80b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:15:30Z","email":"bdwyz2013@126.com","name":"wuyunzhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-06T10:15:30Z","email":"bdwyz2013@126.com","name":"wuyunzhu"},"message":"fix(micro-app): 优化多实例加载与卸载逻辑，防止竞态和重复加载\n\n- 在 MicroAppManager 中增加操作状态标记，避免同时对同一应用重复加载或卸载\n- load 和 unload 方法实现操作排队和等待，保证操作顺序执行\n- iframe 加载增加 finally 块，确保操作状态被清理\n- 调整 MicroAppContainer 组件，卸载已加载实例从无条件卸载改为判断状态再卸载\n- MultiInstancePage 优化同屏应用添加逻辑，避免重复加载，改为激活并刷新已有面板\n- 处理标签页布局切换时的应用重新加载，保证激活标签正确加载对应应用\n- 修复 iframe 多实例页面中重复加载的情况，添加已加载检查和尺寸更新逻辑\n- 所有涉及多实例交互的加载卸载增加日志，便于调试与状态跟踪","tree":{"sha":"dd1e1df02934843e60d0b17ddc812ebab18778a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/my-Sitara/artisan-base-frontend/git/trees/dd1e1df02934843e60d0b17ddc812ebab18778a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/my-Sitara/artisan-base-frontend/git/commits/0b32ec969b363bda315df6569b894f52d3b7c80b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30214225?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/my-Sitara/following{/other_us