.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/daa4b5daa3d09f469d016b565ffdde37beddebac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T02:43:26Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T02:43:26Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"docs(plans): approve e2e harness orphan-leak hardening plan\n\nTPM-approved 2026-04-19 contingent on the canonical orphan-fix\npattern landing in the architecture skill (now upstream at\nskills/lead/go-service-architecture/references/architecture-reference.md).\nFrontmatter only — no content changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f3fafa2b940be29180e309e2f6084f123e763c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/1f3fafa2b940be29180e309e2f6084f123e763c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/daa4b5daa3d09f469d016b565ffdde37beddebac","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f3fafa2b940be29180e309e2f6084f123e763c2\nparent 946d14f8f7663e51d40339800976eea4a60137c3\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776566606 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776566606 -0600\n\ndocs(plans): approve e2e harness orphan-leak hardening plan\n\nTPM-approved 2026-04-19 contingent on the canonical orphan-fix\npattern landing in the architecture skill (now upstream at\nskills/lead/go-service-architecture/references/architecture-reference.md).\nFrontmatter only — no content changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKa