om/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/946d14f8f7663e51d40339800976eea4a60137c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T01:15:17Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T01:15:17Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"docs(plans): add e2e harness orphan-leak hardening plan\n\nApplies the canonical WorkFort e2e-harness orphan-leak pattern\n(Setpgid + *os.File stdio + negative-pid kill + WaitDelay) to\ntests/e2e/harness/harness.go. Sharkfin needs two cleanup paths\nhardened (Stop and StopNoClean) plus the Bridge subprocess, which\ncurrently has no SIGKILL fallback at all. Stop refactored to\nreturn ([]byte, error) so post-teardown stderr is captured.\nMotivated by the CI hang in push 2667cb59 where the workflow step\nwaited ~55 minutes for an orphan sharkfind before cancellation.\nImplements the canonical pattern documented in\nskills/lead/go-service-architecture/references/architecture-reference.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a38333f161dc58af426afb13f62439fac718384","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/5a38333f161dc58af426afb13f62439fac718384"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/946d14f8f7663e51d40339800976eea4a60137c3","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a38333f161dc58af426afb13f62439fac718384\nparent 0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776561317 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776561317 -0600\n\ndocs(plans): add e2e harness orphan-leak hardening plan\n\nApplies the canonical WorkFort e2e-harness orphan-leak pattern\n(Setpgid + *os.File stdio + negative-pid kill + WaitDelay) to\ntests/e2e/harness/harness.go. Sharkfin needs two cleanup paths\nhardened (Stop and StopNoClean) plus the Bridge subprocess, which\ncurrently has no SIGKILL fallback at all. Stop refactored to\nreturn ([]byte, error) so post-teardown stderr is captured.\nMotivated by the CI hang in push 2667cb59 where the workflow step\nwaited ~55 minutes for an orphan sharkfind before cancellation.\nImplements the canonical pattern documented in\nskills/lead/go-service-architecture/references/architecture-reference.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQB7SWIuZOJc9OsFwqZGksiIEkUBIQsbsZCvN24DDvVeoyebRiiKn1GrHEANP/h1MNK\nDLrEzOqIonF8Cqp9U3lQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T03:32:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/946d14f8f7663e51d40339800976eea4a60137c3","node_id":"C_kwDORY6Hf9oAKDk0NmQxNGY4Zjc2NjNlNTFkNDAzMzk4MDA5NzZlZWE0YTYwMTM3YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3","sha":"0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3"}],"sha":"946d14f8f7663e51d40339800976eea4a60137c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/946d14f8f7663e51d40339800976eea4a60137c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T00:31:53Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T00:31:53Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"docs(remaining-work): file three sharkfin bugs surfaced in CI\n\nThree pre-existing bugs surfaced when sharkfin client/go v0.2.0 was\npushed (push 2667cb59):\n\n1. Postgres bool/int migration mismatch on roles.built_in — every\n   e2e-postgres job fails on this; SQLite hides it via integer-to-bool\n   coercion that Postgres rejects.\n2. TestPresenceNoNotificationWithoutMention flakes on a UNIQUE\n   constraint violation on channels.name — per-subtest isolation drift.\n3. TestWSMentionGroupExpansion flakes with \"not a participant\" — likely\n   send-before-join race between subtests.\n\nThe orphan-process / hung-CI-step issue surfaced by the same push is\nnot filed here because it is cross-cutting across six WorkFort e2e\nharnesses; it gets a separate per-repo plan in each affected repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ff599781f71685d3deb23bd7dc7f894f255d19e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/ff599781f71685d3deb23bd7dc7f894f255d19e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3","verification":{"payload":"tree ff599781f71685d3deb23bd7dc7f894f255d19e7\nparent 2667cb599352fdc26a848c3d1ac9a2f5110ddc96\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776558713 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776558713 -0600\n\ndocs(remaining-work): file three sharkfin bugs surfaced in CI\n\nThree pre-existing bugs surfaced when sharkfin client/go v0.2.0 was\npushed (push 2667cb59):\n\n1. Postgres bool/int migration mismatch on roles.built_in — every\n   e2e-postgres job fails on this; SQLite hides it via integer-to-bool\n   coercion that Postgres rejects.\n2. TestPresenceNoNotificationWithoutMention flakes on a UNIQUE\n   constraint violation on channels.name — per-subtest isolation drift.\n3. TestWSMentionGroupExpansion flakes with \"not a participant\" — likely\n   send-before-join race between subtests.\n\nThe orphan-process / hung-CI-step issue surfaced by the same push is\nnot filed here because it is cross-cutting across six WorkFort e2e\nharnesses; it gets a separate per-repo plan in each affected repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGwY2+sSZv/R6qKXj5BGKkAb0TuLvmpZegpuK5hdxAPaPjMZeOal3uQWeF5lwgjFLu\njXp6x4L85o2yMR/Ch2hAI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T00:31:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/0bacb4e08af3cb3ff35f27cf4235cbb65678feb3","node_id":"C_kwDORY6Hf9oAKDBiYWNiNGUwOGFmM2NiM2ZmMzVmMjdjZjQyMzVjYmI2NTY3OGZlYjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/2667cb599352fdc26a848c3d1ac9a2f5110ddc96","sha":"2667cb599352fdc26a