c"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/8bdf4d43168ef8fdc709e9b8286c17e05d90e743/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:57:27Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:57:27Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"feat(client): add RESTClient command methods\n\nImplement all nine REST endpoint methods on RESTClient: Register,\nChannels, CreateChannel, JoinChannel, SendMessage, ListMessages,\nRegisterWebhook, ListWebhooks, and UnregisterWebhook. Each delegates\nto restTransport.do. SendMessage parses SendOpts.Metadata from a JSON\nstring into a map before transmitting so the wire format is a JSON\nobject as the server expects, not a JSON-encoded string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"991513148d75e809e993991e0526d1d10726445b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/991513148d75e809e993991e0526d1d10726445b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/8bdf4d43168ef8fdc709e9b8286c17e05d90e743","verification":{"payload":"tree 991513148d75e809e993991e0526d1d10726445b\nparent 69ad24d8007c28180d6efbe2d9770b65ca2f7805\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776553047 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776553047 -0600\n\nfeat(client): add RESTClient command methods\n\nImplement all nine REST endpoint methods on RESTClient: Register,\nChannels, CreateChannel, JoinChannel, SendMessage, ListMessages,\nRegisterWebhook, ListWebhooks, and UnregisterWebhook. Each delegates\nto restTransport.do. SendMessage parses SendOpts.Metadata from a JSON\nstring into a map before transmitting so the wire format is a JSON\nobject as the server expects, not a JSON-encoded string.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+