ection and that Close is a safe no-op. Currently fails with\n''undefined: NewRESTClient'' — the implementation follows in the next\ncommit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"abdde597337678391801a570fc8f65d72ca7dc41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/abdde597337678391801a570fc8f65d72ca7dc41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/f1121b14f2f59fb01b0cc03b9e2622abbc55e1e5","verification":{"payload":"tree abdde597337678391801a570fc8f65d72ca7dc41\nparent df75cc07d0a502a6b8cbf208caddbb190344a153\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776552988 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776552988 -0600\n\ntest(client): add failing TestNewRESTClient_NoDial\n\nIntroduce the test file for RESTClient. This test verifies that\nNewRESTClient constructs a client without opening any WebSocket\nconnection and that Close is a safe no-op. Currently fails with\n''undefined: NewRESTClient'' — the implementation follows in the next\ncommit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQH9pgzQSwwXvV98EZnFFdoedOEyIHs/R0jFAaeSxyfrb6hTBLmRlJukp+oU4/4zLxv\nriA3aIGq2b3WMo2CI/6QE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T23:06:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/K