,"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:56:12Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T22:56:12Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"feat(client): add HTTP status-mapped sentinel errors\n\nExtend errors.go with four new sentinel errors (ErrBadRequest,\nErrUnauthorized, ErrNotFound, ErrConflict) and update ServerError to\ncarry an HTTP Status field plus a wrapped sentinel. The Unwrap method\nenables errors.Is checks for REST callers. WS callers are unaffected\nsince the WS path constructs ServerError with Message only (zero Status,\nnil wrapped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5a95be98b7a29b87d753957c5f43cfb447fc7b7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/5a95be98b7a29b87d753957c5f43cfb447fc7b7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/df75cc07d0a502a6b8cbf208caddbb190344a153","verification":{"payload":"tree 5a95be98b7a29b87d753957c5f43cfb447fc7b7a\nparent b7ef605ca6c8fe6d77a5645f319c6aed29b3d8e8\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776552972 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776552972 -0600\n\nfeat(client): add HTTP status-mapped sentinel errors\n\nExtend errors.go with four new sentinel errors (ErrBadRequest,\nErrUnauthorized, ErrNotFound, ErrConflict) and update ServerError to\ncarry an HTTP Status field plus a wrapped sentinel. The Unwrap method\nenables errors.Is checks for REST callers. WS callers are unaffected\nsince the WS path constructs ServerError with Message only (zero Status,\nnil wrapped).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQAZuu7bQEE9Z7zDozRY/ZtIM1Ap9+cupJRFgWjX7x7h6vwdVqOgJVR3tdL9+4o+x9u\nex/bfJigmF9EPj0OP9og0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-18T23:06:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/df75cc07d0a502a6b8cbf208caddbb190344a153","node_id":"C_kwDORY6Hf9oAKGRmNzVjYzA3ZDBhNTAyYTZiOGNiZjIwOGNhZGRiYjE5MDM0NGExNTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/b7ef605ca6c8fe6d77a5645f319c6aed29b3d8e8","sha":"b7ef605ca6c8fe6d77a5645f319c6aed29b3d8e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/b7ef605ca6c8fe6d77a5645f319c6aed29b3d8e8"}],"sha":"df75cc07d0a502a6b8cbf208caddbb190344a153","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/df75cc07d0a502a6b8cbf208caddbb190344a153"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","n