zW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/ed18caa69b7e852a91304856253bc703850961e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T07:43:52Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T07:43:52Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"docs: file HTTP server missing timeouts bug\n\npkg/daemon/server.go constructs http.Server with only Addr/Handler — no\nReadTimeout, WriteTimeout, IdleTimeout, or ReadHeaderTimeout, which\nleaves the service open to Slowloris-class attacks. Filing from\nintegration testing; not a fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"88db05e525d5b821ebdaddd7fba293eaa078e7ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/88db05e525d5b821ebdaddd7fba293eaa078e7ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/ed18caa69b7e852a91304856253bc703850961e9","verification":{"payload":"tree 88db05e525d5b821ebdaddd7fba293eaa078e7ff\nparent ef5ebbe0046858417fb3e4d7d8eb6e1a8984d2d1\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776411832 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1776411832 -0600\n\ndocs: file HTTP server missing timeouts bug\n\npkg/daemon/server.go constructs http.Server with only Addr/Handler — no\nReadTimeout, WriteTimeout, IdleTimeout, or ReadHeaderTimeout, which\nleaves the service open to Slowloris-class attacks. Filing from\nintegration testing; not a fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09m