ed identity username decoupling to planned work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8364e399a6b3159856bb762a6e96955cafbb7af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/a8364e399a6b3159856bb762a6e96955cafbb7af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/1bb2d7f1008eb8564c2d404346cb90d0a3fe1528","verification":{"payload":"tree a8364e399a6b3159856bb762a6e96955cafbb7af\nparent 598fdd7efb6afd9ea1b2825003bd72ebd59c1e7a\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1775395159 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1775395159 -0600\n\ndocs: add Flow adapter REST API plan, requirements, rename tracking doc\n\n- Implementation plan for REST endpoints, Go client library updates,\n  and webhook secret field removal. Assessed and approved.\n- Flow adapter requirements document (HMAC signing removed from scope).\n- Renamed remaining-ui-work.md → remaining-work.md (covers more than UI).\n- Added identity username decoupling to planned work.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPQovyqyQPcOyCRfVAUK8d03eyL8jvQ9Wogo2sv8ZOe2BqITnf1AnKOMDUiJK4R6WA\nZZxrjvJd+Rhku5VCROTA8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-05T13:50:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/1bb2d7f1008eb8564c2d404346cb90d0a3fe1528","node_id":"C_kwDORY6Hf9oAKDFiYjJkN2YxMDA4ZWI4NTY0YzJkNDA0MzQ2Y2I5MGQwYTNmZTE1Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/598fdd7efb6afd9ea1b2825003bd72ebd59c1e7a","sha":"598fdd7efb6afd9ea1b2825003bd72ebd59c1e7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/598fdd7efb6afd9ea1b2825003bd72ebd59c1e7a"}],"sha":"1bb2d7f1008eb8564c2d404346cb90d0a3fe1528","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/1bb2d7f1008eb8564c2d404346cb90d0a3fe1528"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/598fdd7efb6afd9ea1b2825003bd72ebd59c1e7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T11:08:46Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T11:08:46Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"fix: align SQLite webhook upsert with Postgres semantics\n\nUse ON CONFLICT(identity_id, url) DO UPDATE SET active = 1, secret = excluded.secret\ninstead of INSERT OR IGNORE, so re-registering the same URL re-enables a\ndeactivated webhook and updates its secret — matching Postgres behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca5a5a001408da9fb3a9d352c056f95cceb2e277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/ca5a5a001408da9fb3a9d352c056f95cceb2e277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/598fdd7efb6afd9ea1b2825003bd72ebd59c1e7a","verification":{"payload":"tree ca5a5a001408da9fb3a9d352c056f95cceb2e277\nparent e4d114edcc8ce5065205b9faa255a10fdf5c03e4\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1775387326 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1775387326 -0600\n\nfix: align SQLite webhook upsert with Postgres semantics\n\nUse ON CONFLICT(identity_id, url) DO UPDATE SET active = 1, secret = excluded.secret\ninstead of INSERT OR IGNORE, so re-registering the same URL re-enables a\ndeactivated webhook and updates its secret — matching Postgres behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDVmi6TnuEDDFZJsSYt70fo4JZTLxhJOxtaSrCcVtGzsbnDpQQa+vWRRISplstUwiS\nDrN7sLvYO+APd0FUeXbwY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-05T13:50:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http