arred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/e4d114edcc8ce5065205b9faa255a10fdf5c03e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-05T11:06:13Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-05T11:06:13Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"fix: address code review findings (webhook dedup, N+1, list_webhooks tool)\n\n- Add GetServiceMemberUsernames(channelID) to ChannelStore interface and\n  both SQLite/Postgres stores: single SQL JOIN replaces N+1 GetIdentityByUsername\n  calls in computeRecipients\n- Refactor computeRecipients to accept channelID from caller; hoist member\n  list fetch before DM and service-member branches (was two ChannelMemberUsernames\n  calls for DM channels)\n- Restructure handleMessage to resolve channel once and pass ch.ID to\n  computeRecipients, eliminating double GetChannelByName\n- Fix presence_notifier.go to pass channelID to updated computeRecipients\n- Add list_webhooks MCP tool (newListWebhooksTool + handleListWebhooks) backed\n  by existing GetActiveWebhooksForIdentity store method\n- Add UNIQUE(identity_id, url) index via migration 012_webhook_dedup.sql for\n  both SQLite and Postgres; use INSERT OR IGNORE (SQLite) and ON CONFLICT DO\n  UPDATE (Postgres) for idempotent re-registration\n- Add clarifying comment to optionalString helper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f0d3a2f251aab7dc522a811302bf785fd84485d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/0f0d3a2f251aab7dc522a811302bf785fd84485d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/e4d114edcc8ce5065205b9faa255a10fdf5c03e4","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f0d3a2f251aab7dc522a811302bf785fd84485d\nparent 4ecf3e73d0f72d00416fe031b4e76a9f6aa43019\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1775387173 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1775387173 -0600\n\nfix: address code review findings (webhook dedup, N+1, list_webhooks tool)\n\n- Add GetServiceMemberUsernames(channelID) to ChannelStore interface and\n  both SQLite/Postgres stores: single SQL JOIN replaces N+1 GetIdentityByUsername\n  calls in computeRecipients\n- Refactor computeRecipients to accept channelID from caller; hoist member\n  list fetch before DM and service-member branches (was two ChannelMemberUsernames\n  calls for DM channels)\n- Restructure handleMessage to resolve channel once and pass ch.ID to\n  computeRecipients, eliminating double GetChannelByName\n- Fix presence_notifier.go to pass channelID to updated computeRecipients\n- Add list_webhooks MCP tool (newListWebhooksTool + handleListWebhooks) backed\n  by existing GetActiveWebhooksForIdentity store method\n- Add UNIQUE(identity_id, url) index via migration 012_webhook_dedup.sql for\n  both SQLite and Postgres; use INSERT OR IGNORE (SQLite) and ON CONFLICT DO\n  UPDATE (Postgres) for idempotent re-registration\n- Add clarifying comment to optionalString helper\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQIBXRWqPbaLF/9cAour8YZqsgpQfKkBjXgfGUdtnBPMD8+0SHzBDkIJjmf43N8t2gf\nHizZgt2z8+stN0N0MiFgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-05T13:50:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com