 are isolated — computations\nin the shell''s render tree can''t track them. Moving the permission\nstore creation to module level (before createRoot) allows components\nto reactively track permission changes.\n\nRoot cause: createSignal inside createRoot → memo in component tree\ncan''t track → Show when={canHistory()} never re-evaluates.","tree":{"sha":"35eead014455c767d520cf25de0e4d45f79ba518","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/35eead014455c767d520cf25de0e4d45f79ba518"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/e705b5a90a60bf2191e0df99b218aa32456f15bf","verification":{"payload":"tree 35eead014455c767d520cf25de0e4d45f79ba518\nparent 7165c480513f5a4a98d3800594185433f910ff8d\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1773785216 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1773785216 -0600\n\nfix: move permission store outside createRoot for cross-tree reactivity\n\nSolidJS signals created inside createRoot are isolated — computations\nin the shell''s render tree can''t track them. Moving the permission\nstore creation to module level (before createRoot) allows components\nto reactively track permission changes.\n\nRoot cause: createSignal inside createRoot → memo in component tree\ncan''t track → Show when={canHistory()} never re-evaluates.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLz+Ndwk67U2JtxiatpIvXGnxj0OV8gtZxy8/28O0v4cDQjKIv6LtTET3LaLNW1rsg\nf0322Nz9cG48aWPpBaRgQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-18T10:57:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/e705b5a90a60bf2191e0df99b218aa32456f15bf","node_id":"C_kwDORY6Hf9oAKGU3MDViNWE5MGE2MGJmMjE5MWUwZGY5OWIyMThhYTMyNDU2ZjE1YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commit/7165c480513f5a4a98d3800594185433f910ff8d","sha":"7165c480513f5a4a98d3800594185433f910ff8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/7165c480513f5a4a98d3800594185433f910ff8d"}],"sha":"e705b5a90a60bf2191e0df99b218aa32456f15bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/e705b5a90a60bf2191e0df99b218aa32456f15bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/598968?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KazW","id":598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/7165c480513f5a4a98d3800594185433f910ff8d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T21:56:57Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T21:56:57Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"fix: use createMemo for permission checks in SolidJS components\n\nSolidJS compiler treats permissions.can(''x'') as a static expression\nin JSX — the signal read inside can() isn''t tracked. Using createMemo\nwraps the call in a reactive computation that SolidJS tracks properly.\n\nAlso seeds \"general\" channel on first startup and shows empty state\nmessage when no channels exist.","tree":{"sha":"daf7e22d91fc3e2c4032c0a9d92d1df44afdd0a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/daf7e22d91fc3e2c4032c0a9d92d1df44afdd0a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/7165c480513f5a4a98d3800594185433f910ff8d","verification":{"payload":"tree daf7e22d91fc3e2c4032c0a9d92d1df44afdd0a0\nparent 089b0bcaa3bbcca763db90c344b6899efae297a4\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1773784617 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1773784617 -0600\n\nfix: use createMemo for permission checks in SolidJS components\n\nSolidJS compiler treats permissions.can(''x'') as a static expression\nin JSX — the signal read inside can() isn''t tracked. Using createMemo\nwraps the call in a reactive computation that SolidJS tracks properly.\n\nAlso seeds \"general\" channel on first startup and shows empty state\nmessage when no channels exist.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg/wfa09mYovkTIpmBDKaxr+x8j2\nH8LU4Ovj81kHmEUf8AAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDxBxEw/rsgqvHIYl5hi1vVuuy/0BUy/jl8RVwt3PIwXHsvefMJ6+lzuH89fHiWKHj\nQgP4Fh9C