598968,"login":"KazW","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODk2OA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KazW","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/commits/089b0bcaa3bbcca763db90c344b6899efae297a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T21:40:11Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T21:40:11Z","email":"me@kazatron.com","name":"Kaz Walker"},"message":"fix: revert () => wrapper, add channel seed + empty state\n\nThe () => wrapper in Show when={} was wrong — SolidJS treats the\nfunction object as truthy. Reverted to direct calls. Added:\n- Seed \"general\" channel on first startup (empty DB)\n- Empty state message when no channels exist\n- Debug logging in permissions (temporary)","tree":{"sha":"cf2c33d8c9bddf42ec5ecbfa613d9b6bc32bd537","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/trees/cf2c33d8c9bddf42ec5ecbfa613d9b6bc32bd537"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Work-Fort/Sharkfin/git/commits/089b0bcaa3bbcca763db90c344b6899efae297a4","verification":{"payload":"tree cf2c33d8c9bddf42ec5ecbfa613d9b6bc32bd537\nparent 12d340250ae14694eb0596b2a8e84aee1da775d6\nauthor Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1773783611 -0600\ncommitter Kaz Walker <me@kazatron.com> 1773783611 -0600\n\nfix: revert () => wrapper, add channel seed + empty state\n\nThe () => wrapper in Show when={} was wrong — SolidJS treats the\nfunction object as truthy. Reverted to direct calls. Added:\n- Seed \"general\" channel on first startup (empty DB)\n- Empty state message when no channels exist\n- Debug logging in permissions (tempor