show\nevery visitor a Local Network Access prompt.\n\n- vite.config.ts: remote localhost defaults apply to the dev server\n  only; unset remotes are left out of the federation map in builds.\n- frame-agent-client: single FRAME_AGENT_URL (localhost:4001 in dev\n  only, '''' otherwise — same-origin / demo mode per ADR-0013), reused by\n  App, HeaderConnected, ResumptionToastConnected, approvalQueueSlice.\n- appRegistrySlice: remoteUrl localhost defaults DEV-gated.\n- scripts/check-no-loopback.sh + CI step after build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d77be91bd7a8cb77cabcf01ec6608d0ff5fe3ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/1d77be91bd7a8cb77cabcf01ec6608d0ff5fe3ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/8e3a839b65dc55e12b6b3da9e099bf97100ef18f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/8e3a839b65dc55e12b6b3da9e099bf97100ef18f","node_id":"C_kwDORY-IhNoAKDh