nizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/dbce227cebfdfd63298a319f266c0e041037218e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T23:56:58Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T04:15:02Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(remotes): register asset_foundry MF remote at :3035\n\nPairs with the asset-foundry phase4.2 commit. Adds asset-foundry as a\nModule Federation remote to the shell host so booting `pnpm dev` at\nlocalhost:4000 surfaces an \"Asset Foundry\" tile alongside the existing\ncv-builder / blogengine / tripplanner / lean-canvas / gastown-pilot ones.\n\nOne-line change to remoteBase. Default URL http://localhost:3035 matches\nthe asset-foundry side''s vite dev port (locked in\nasset-foundry/decisions/adr/0010-ui-host-integration.md). Override at\ndeploy time via VITE_REMOTE_ASSET_FOUNDRY.\n\nThe asset-foundry remote exposes ./Dashboard from\napps/web/src/components/Dashboard.tsx, version-matched on the shared\nsingletons (react / react-dom / @carbon/react) per the convention this\nhost already enforces.\n\nTo run:\n  Terminal 1 (shell):           pnpm dev          (this repo, :4000)\n  Terminal 2 (asset-foundry):   pnpm foundry mcp-http       (:3036)\n  Terminal 3 (asset-foundry):   pnpm --filter @asset-foundry/web dev   (:3035)\n\nThen visit http://localhost:4000 — the Asset Foundry tab should show the\nlist of registered targets via the foundry.target.list MCP tool.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b3b450b9fbabf3e75e7e59b326ce2cdf8f77381","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/7b3b450b9fbabf3e75e7e59b326ce2cdf8f77381"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/dbce227cebfdfd63298a319f266c0e041037218e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/dbce227cebfdfd63298a319f266c0e041037218e","node_id":"C_kwDORY-IhNoAKGRiY2UyMjdjZWJmZGZkNjMyOThhMzE5ZjI2NmMwZTA0MTAzNzIxOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/a6e0de9740e8f85f0ba269696a0d545f3717f58f","sha":"a6e0de9740e8f85f0ba269696a0d545f3717f58f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/a6e0de9740e8f85f0ba269696a0d545f3717f58f"}],"sha":"dbce227cebfdfd63298a319f266c0e041037218e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/dbce227cebfdfd63298a319f266c0e041037218e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u