thub.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat: ADR-0013 cross-domain fanout, FrameBus PoC, Playwright deep-link test\n\nThree backlog items addressed:\n\n1. ADR-0013: Formalises the cross-domain fan-out and synthesis protocol\n   from docs/plan-cross-domain-fanout.md into a versioned decision record.\n\n2. FrameBus PoC (per ADR-0034): typed pub/sub message bus using\n   BroadcastChannel with CustomEvent fallback. Typed event catalog in\n   frame-bus.ts, Redux middleware publishes shell:theme-changed and\n   shell:active-app-changed. Sub-apps can subscribe to coordinate.\n\n3. Playwright deep-link smoke test: bootstraps Playwright in the shell\n   workspace with 3 tests covering ?app= deep-link activation, default\n   HomeScreen, and invalid app param handling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"099b69f3705f594f9b2689e0667caa52d3994026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/099b69f3705f594f9b2689e0667caa52d3994026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/39b1ab3824da93dd0af472df6bb15d39c9c69b10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/u