d298658db046/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-19T20:25:09Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-19T20:49:00Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(ui): container/presenter decomposition for ApprovalQueue, ResumptionToast, SettingsModal\n\nExtract 3 smart shell-app components into pure prop-only @ojfbot/shell\ncomponents with Storybook stories:\n\n- ApprovalQueue: items + loading + onApprove/onReject callbacks\n- ResumptionToast: summary + suggestions + onSuggestionClick/onDismiss\n- SettingsModal: all config via props (contextAppType, appTypes, labels,\n  settingsMeta, settingsLoaders) — no Redux selector\n\nConnected wrappers in shell-app wire Redux dispatch/selectors:\n- ApprovalQueueConnected: polling + fetchApprovals/approveHook/rejectHook\n- ResumptionToastConnected: sendMessage + clearResumptionSummary\n- SettingsModalConnected: reads activeAppType from store\n\nAlso:\n- Add AppFrameDisplay + tokens to @ojfbot/shell exports\n- Remove dead ShellHeader.tsx (replaced by HeaderConnected + @ojfbot/shell Header)\n\nShell ui package now exports 8 pure components with 9 stories total.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33061486ad14975d971f9240c49238e36c5d01be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/33061486ad14975d971f9240c49238e36c5d01be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/6c56459fd1bae150a7a1bc6a681fd298658db046","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user