hub.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/f51dca2256cf58067350514831d8824859401c50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/3621e5c621d1d7dda2a4feae11a327af7ff8762a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-18T02:10:14Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-18T02:27:28Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(shell): platform features — NL instance spawning, thread resumption, G3 Approval Queue\n\nNL instance spawning (Phase 4):\n- MetaOrchestratorAgent.detectSpawnIntent(): keyword fast-path (zero latency on\n  non-spawn messages); Claude call returns { appType, instanceName } JSON\n- Runs in Promise.all with classify() — no serial latency penalty\n- SpawnInstanceAction attached to FrameAgentResponse, passed through SSE done event\n- chatSlice sendMessage thunk dispatches spawnInstance on action detection\n- frame-agent-client: SpawnInstanceAction type + SSE done callback carries action\n\nThread resumption (per-session):\n- threadHistoryStore.ts: localStorage persistence (ojfbot:thread:{instanceId}:{threadId})\n  + sessionStorage once-per-session gate (ojfbot:resumed:{instanceId}:{threadId})\n- POST /api/resumption: synthesizes summary + 2-4 follow-up suggestions via Claude\n  structured JSON; returns { resumption, suggestions }\n- chatSlice: requestResumption thunk, resumptionSummary + resumptionSuggestions state\n- ResumptionToast.tsx: fixed bottom-right, no auto-dismiss, suggestion badges dispatch\n  sendMessage directly, clears on next user message\n\nG3 Approval Queue (Paperclip governance):\n- GET /api/approvals: reads ~/.beads/<prefix>/<agentId>.json directly, returns all\n  agents with hook_approval_status = ''pending''\n- POST /api/approvals/:agentId/approve|reject: updates approval_status in bead file\n- approvalQueueSlice.ts: fetch/approve/reject thunks with optimistic removal\n- ApprovalQueue.tsx: fixed panel (hides when empty), polls every 15s, Approve/Reject\n  buttons per pending agent\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d9f4345b56e4fb50dbb81245d29103c3c9f2e32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/9d9f4345b56e4fb50dbb81245d29103c3c9f2e32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/3621e5c621d1d7dda2a4feae11a327af7ff8762a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.gith