mments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/2e6e5f2bd49918af3d679c54f2a3ba091e90c8e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T02:02:19Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:26:16Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(shell): patch persisted registry for all DEFAULT_APP_TYPES, not just singletons\n\nPreviously the migration only injected missing instances for singleton app types.\nlean-canvas (singleton: false) was added to DEFAULT_APP_TYPES but never bootstrapped\ninto persisted state — leaving it with \"No instances\" on reload.\n\nFix: iterate DEFAULT_APP_TYPES (now exported) instead of filtering by cfg.singleton.\nAny app type with no existing instances in persisted state gets its default instance\ninjected. This generalises the migration for all future non-singleton app additions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b1e3e56c2b2951e1ff7794d4382dccee810db77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/4b1e3e56c2b2951e1ff7794d4382dccee810db77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/2e6e5f2bd49918af3d679c54f2a3ba091e90c8e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","rep