ly.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T04:26:16Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(shell): register lean-canvas as Frame OS sub-app + purefoy API port fix\n\nlean-canvas registration (all 11 points):\n- vite.config.ts: lean_canvas remote at :3025 (VITE_REMOTE_LEAN_CANVAS)\n- .env.production: VITE_REMOTE_LEAN_CANVAS=https://canvas.jim.software\n- ui/src/types.ts: AppType union includes ''lean-canvas''\n- appRegistrySlice.ts: APP_CONFIG, AppType, DEFAULT_APP_TYPES\n- AppFrame.tsx: REMOTE_LOADERS[''lean-canvas''] → lean_canvas/Dashboard\n- HomeScreen.tsx (shell-app + ui): lean-canvas row with Analytics icon\n- settings-loaders.ts: SETTINGS_LOADERS + SETTINGS_META for lean-canvas\n- SettingsModal.tsx: SETTINGS_APP_TYPES includes ''lean-canvas''\n- settingsSlice.ts: LeanCanvasSettings interface + updateLeanCanvasSettings reducer\n- domain-registry.ts: lean-canvas domain keywords (lean canvas, business model, etc.)\n\npurefoy API port: corrected 3020 → 3021 (3020 = MF remote, 3021 = Express API)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a521ab54b65c6664788f9f224f8929edf7b551bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/a521ab54b65c6664788f9f224f8929edf7b551bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/c19b6f8a6686f97b26a03ce41582c1a13e5cfabc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg",