n constraint.\n- content: z.string().max(4000) prevents unbounded token cost from\n  oversized messages slipping through schema validation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e002ed53a6b622275055a5da7fbd070e8113d48b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/e002ed53a6b622275055a5da7fbd070e8113d48b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/9c5a4558c89a65df07474b4ffc2402002a66fbf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/9c5a4558c89a65df07474b4ffc2402002a66fbf2","node_id":"C_kwDORY-IhNoAKDljNWE0NTU4Yzg5YTY1ZGYwNzQ3NGI0ZmZjMjQwMjAwMmE2NmZiZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a","sha":"c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a"}],"sha":"9c5a4558c89a65df07474b4ffc2402002a66fbf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/9c5a4558c89a65df07474b4ffc2402002a66fbf2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-12T01:14:51Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-12T03:44:11Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(frame-agent): POST /api/resumption — thread resumption synthesis endpoint\n\nStateless synthesis: takes conversationHistory + activeAppType, returns a\n1-2 sentence contextual opener from the last 6 messages.\n- Separate endpoint (not prepended to chat) — avoids phantom history turns\n- Follows POST /api/inspect pattern; rate-limited via getRateLimiter(''standard'')\n- Returns null when history.length < 2 (nothing to synthesize from)\n- Shell should call on thread load when activeInstance has prior messages;\n  surface resumption as ambient context above input, not as a chat bubble\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38fb3b89f2c8c4c6ac2d7b1748a34cf0c602c33c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/38fb3b89f2c8c4c6ac2d7b1748a34cf0c602c33c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a","node_id":"C_kwDORY-IhNoAKGMyMjkyMmVmZjRlOTVhMGRiNTA3MTRjNjc3YzI3MDA1YWI5OGNmNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d","sha":"37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d"}],"sha":"c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/c22922eff4e95a0db50714c677c27005ab98cf5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T04:22:29Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T04:26:09Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"refactor(shell): rename cv-builder → resume-builder across all packages\n\nEliminates the cv-builder namespace to prevent routing confusion.\nAll AppType literals, MF remote keys, env vars, agent classes, Redux\nactions, and file name updated to resume-builder / ResumeBuilder.\n\n- AppType: ''cv-builder'' → ''resume-builder'' (appRegistrySlice, settingsSlice, ui/types)\n- MF remote key: cv_builder → resume_builder (vite.config, AppFrame, settings-loaders)\n- Env var: VITE_REMOTE_CV_BUILDER / CV_BUILDER_API_URL → RESUME_BUILDER_* equivalents\n- Agent: CvBuilderDomainAgent → ResumeBuilderDomainAgent; file renamed to resume-builder-agent.ts\n- DomainType: ''cv-builder'' → ''resume-builder'' (meta-orchestrator, chat route, domain-registry)\n- Redux: CvBuilderSettings → ResumeBuilderSettings; updateCvBuilderSettings → updateResumeBuilderSettings\n- SubAppUrls.cvBuilderApi → resumeBuilderApi (meta-orchestrator, frame-agent-manager)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae59ae3425748ebcf5f6c140f843732c75f13089","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/ae59ae3425748ebcf5f6c140f843732c75f13089"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d","node_id":"C_kwDORY-IhNoAKDM3Y2FhMzcyODVmMmI4ODMwMWZhOTQ5MjMzYzlkMGUzODk0Y2QyNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/785a3af425f6ba0c0c2b22b788e01d58acd77309","sha":"785a3af425f6ba0c0c2b22b788e01d58acd77309","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/785a3af425f6ba0c0c2b22b788e01d58acd77309"}],"sha":"37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/37caa37285f2b88301fa949233c9d0e3894cd26d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/785a3af425f6ba0c0c2b22b788e01d58acd77309/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-11T03:34:14Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T03:59:46Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"fix(shell): cross-domain detection + Resume Builder display labels\n\nCross-domain routing fix:\n- hasCrossDomainSignal() now detects keyword co-presence across 2+ DOMAIN_REGISTRY\n  domains, not just connective phrases (\"and also\", \"both\", etc.)\n- Cross-domain fast-path runs before active-app fast-path so hero-demo queries\n  (\"I''m applying for Berlin jobs, how does this affect my trip plans?\") are never\n  mis-routed to the active app regardless of activeAppType context\n- Removes redundant hasCrossDomainSignal check from active-app fast-path (now unreachable)\n\nResume Builder labels:\n- APP_CONFIG label + defaultInstanceName: \"CV Builder\"/\"My CV\" → \"Resume Builder\"/\"My Resume\"\n  (single source — APP_LABELS, Settings tabs, and header badge all derive from APP_CONFIG)\n- ShellHeader placeholder: uses APP_CONFIG label instead of raw AppType string\n- ShellHeader domain badge: uses APP_CONFIG label (falls back to raw string for meta/cross-domain)\n- HomeScreen tile label: \"CV Builder\" → \"Resume Builder\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbd51e308ae38b17116d00d66c7913f126702164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/bbd51e308ae38b17116d00d66c7913f126702164"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/785a3af425f6ba0c0c2b22b788e01d58acd77309","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot","id":151410806,"login":"ojfbot","node_id":"U_kgDOCQZYdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/785a3af425f6ba0c0c2b22b788e01d58acd77309","node_id":"C_kwDORY-IhNoAKDc4NWEzYWY0MjVmNmJhMGMwYzJiMjJiNzg4ZTAxZDU4YWNkNzczMDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ojfbot/shell/commit/f02743c0f8f59582e1ee206d1b1d8f5e392db2ca","sha":"f0274