ceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/c81c19eb2f364627cbbd7466c74a41a486dfff99/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-10T00:13:29Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-11T00:35:49Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(shell): scaffold @ojfbot/shell package, extract AppSwitcher [Phase 1]\n\nValidates the component extraction pattern ahead of full Phase 1.\n\n- packages/ui/ — new @ojfbot/shell package (private: false)\n  - AppSwitcher.tsx — pure props-based component; no Redux imports\n  - AppSwitcherProps interface exported from index.ts\n  - Storybook config (@storybook/react-vite): 4 stories covering default,\n    multi-instance, no-active, and empty states\n  - Types: AppType, AppInstance, AppDisplayConfig\n- AppSwitcherConnected.tsx — thin Redux wrapper in shell-app; maps store\n  state + dispatch to AppSwitcherProps; owns the spawn-name deduplication logic\n- App.tsx — imports AppSwitcherConnected instead of the old Redux-coupled AppSwitcher\n- shell-app package.json — @ojfbot/shell: workspace:*\n- shell-app tsconfig.json — path alias @ojfbot/shell → ../ui/src/index.ts\n- pnpm-lock.yaml — updated\n\nOriginal AppSwitcher.tsx in shell-app is intentionally preserved as the\nRedux-coupled reference; it will be removed in a follow-up once the pattern\nis validated and remaining callers are migrated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0759fb3b3c0f4091e15eeb8c5f71b5a11ce9c6c0","url":"https://ap