ttps://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/commits/e910836489ac74c9e7d379b1d397eb619c7009c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:03:39Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-09T04:25:18Z","email":"151410806+ojfbot@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ojfbot"},"message":"feat(shell): singleton app type enforcement for purefoy + core-reader\n\npurefoy and core-reader were missing from DEFAULT_APP_TYPES, leaving them\nwith no instances and completely unreachable from the UI.\n\n- Add `singleton?: boolean` to AppConfig; mark purefoy + core-reader as singletons\n- Add both to DEFAULT_APP_TYPES so they are bootstrapped on first load\n- Export DEFAULT_INSTANCES so the store can use it during migration\n- Guard spawnInstance reducer: no-op if a singleton already has an instance\n- Hide the + New button in AppSwitcher for singleton types\n- Migrate persisted registry on load: inject missing singleton instances for\n  users whose stored state predates this change\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4b838ecbea684793acbaf44121daebbf24f5cf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/trees/a4b838ecbea684793acbaf44121daebbf24f5cf5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ojfbot/shell/git/commits/e910836489ac74c9e7d379b1d397eb619c7009c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151410806?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojfbot/gists{/gist_id}","gra