lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commit/4cb132e8bd327fc8fae6a5d1cb8005853199d4aa","node_id":"C_kwDORY-jINoAKDRjYjEzMmU4YmQzMjdmYzhmYWU2YTVkMWNiODAwNTg1MzE5OWQ0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commit/60b0a9f0e7b19a35e88c9b4e7ea214261700ee15","sha":"60b0a9f0e7b19a35e88c9b4e7ea214261700ee15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commits/60b0a9f0e7b19a35e88c9b4e7ea214261700ee15"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commit/3d0aecdddbe93886b5c98257023ecc7dd665ef19","sha":"3d0aecdddbe93886b5c98257023ecc7dd665ef19","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commits/3d0aecdddbe93886b5c98257023ecc7dd665ef19"}],"sha":"4cb132e8bd327fc8fae6a5d1cb8005853199d4aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commits/4cb132e8bd327fc8fae6a5d1cb8005853199d4aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/8329?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/vercel","id":35613825,"login":"vercel[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzU2MTM4MjU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vercel%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/commits/3d0aecdddbe93886b5c98257023ecc7dd665ef19/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T00:46:33Z","email":"vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vercel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T00:46:33Z","email":"vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vercel"},"message":"Add Vercel Web Analytics to project\n\n# Vercel Web Analytics Implementation\n\nSuccessfully implemented Vercel Web Analytics for the single-spa root microfrontend application.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. Installed @vercel/analytics Package\n- Added `@vercel/analytics` version ^1.6.1 to the project dependencies\n- Updated `apps/root/package.json` to include the new package\n- Updated `pnpm-lock.yaml` with the new dependency resolution\n\n### 2. Integrated Analytics Tracking\n- Modified `apps/root/src/index.ts` to import and initialize analytics\n- Added `import { inject } from ''@vercel/analytics'';` at the top of the file\n- Called `inject()` function after initializing single-spa to enable analytics tracking\n\n## Implementation Details\n\nFor this single-spa microfrontend application, I used the `inject()` function approach from `@vercel/analytics`. This is the recommended approach for:\n- Framework-agnostic implementations\n- Single-page applications with custom routing\n- Applications where adding React components might not be suitable\n\nThe `inject()` function is called once in the main application entry point (`index.ts`), ensuring analytics tracking is initialized across all microfrontends (header, footer, and content).\n\n## Files Modified\n\n- `apps/root/package.json` - Added @vercel/analytics dependency\n- `apps/root/src/index.ts` - Imported and initialized analytics tracking\n- `pnpm-lock.yaml` - Updated with new dependency locks\n\n## Verification\n\n- ✅ Build completed successfully with no errors\n- ✅ All TypeScript types are correct\n- ✅ Analytics will start tracking once deployed to Vercel with Analytics enabled in the dashboard\n\n## Next Steps\n\nTo complete the setup:\n1. Deploy the application to Vercel using `vercel deploy`\n2. Enable Web Analytics in the Vercel dashboard (Project → Analytics → Enable)\n3. Verify tracking by checking for `/_vercel/insights/view` requests in the browser''s Network tab\n4. View analytics data in the Vercel dashboard after deployment\n\n## Notes\n\n- The implementation uses the `inject()` function which provides automatic page view tracking\n- No route support is included with this approach, but it works seamlessly with single-spa''s routing\n- Analytics tracking is only active in production environments by default\n- The tracking script is loaded asynchronously and won''t impact page load performance\n\nCo-authored-by: Vercel <vercel[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7cf1e2d86cd4070d1445937b43fd00426bd04a86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/git/trees/7cf1e2d86cd4070d1445937b43fd00426bd04a86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roseliux/microfrontends-single-spa/git/commits/3d0aecdddbe93886b5c98257023ecc7dd665ef19","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/8329?v=4","events_url":"htt