4MDRiMGI5ZTIwOWU1ZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/d0006043a18b2d4b26e3b329b79e7ebbec269324","sha":"d0006043a18b2d4b26e3b329b79e7ebbec269324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/d0006043a18b2d4b26e3b329b79e7ebbec269324"}],"sha":"baabe3480841359b64c7c1fb8804b0b9e209e5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/baabe3480841359b64c7c1fb8804b0b9e209e5e5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/d0006043a18b2d4b26e3b329b79e7ebbec269324/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:04:07Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T06:04:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(bucket-api-contract-tests): fix latent header type error + add typecheck script (#42)\n\nThe contract suite''s BucketApiClient.download() assigned Axios response\nheaders (AxiosHeaderValue | undefined, which includes null) straight to\nfields typed string | undefined, so `tsc --noEmit` errored at client.ts:205.\nIt went unnoticed because the package had no `typecheck` script — the\nrepo-wide `pnpm -r --if-present typecheck` skipped it, and Vitest runs via\nesbuild, which ignores types.\n\n- Coerce each header to string | undefined via a small `h()` helper.\n- Add `typecheck` to the package so it joins the enforced gate and the\n  error can''t silently regress.\n\ntsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json now passes (0 errors); lint + format clean;\noffline test:run still skips cleanly.","tree":{"sha":"8357be7d70d8e09a4b49c79334aff735e0e206cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/8357be7d70d8e09a4b49c79334aff735e0e206cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/d0006043a18b2d4b26e3b329b79e7ebbec269324","verification":{"payload":"tree 8357be7d70d8e09a4b49c79334aff735e0e206cb\nparent 9b9563f02a427fd54143efa33189c98f056fbfcb\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1780812247 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780812247 +0800\n\nchore(bucket-api-contract-tests): fix latent header type error + add typecheck script (#42)\n\nThe contract suite''s BucketApiClient.download() assigned Axios response\nheaders (AxiosHeaderValue | undefined, which includes null) straight to\nfields typed string | undefined, so `tsc --noEmit` errored at client.ts:205.\nIt went unnoticed because the package had no `typecheck` script — the\nrepo-wide `pnpm -r --if-present typecheck` skipped it, and Vitest runs via\nesbuild, which ignores types.\n\n- Coerce each header to string | undefined via a small `h()` helper.\n- Add `typecheck` to the package so it joins the enforced gate and the\n  error can''t silently regress.\n\ntsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.json now passes (0 errors); lint + format clean;\noffline test:run still skips cleanly.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATUR