"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/f6d9b4614469dd69ce9806a0e7fc66e243963760/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T09:05:09Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"docs: document regenerating Garage API types from the OpenAPI spec\n\nThe hand-curated src/types/garage.ts can drift from the upstream contract\n(public/garage-admin-v2.json). Document the openapi-typescript regen + reconcile\nstep to run at Garage Admin API version bumps. A full migration to generated\ntypes is deliberately left as a separate, focused refactor — the curated types\nare ergonomic and currently accurate (verified against a live cluster).\n\nRefs #14.","tree":{"sha":"4eed1d7985463da6b2250cea186dd395a504b777","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/4eed1d7985463da6b2250cea186dd395a504b777"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/f6d9b4614469dd69ce9806a0e7fc66e243963760","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://a