/garage-admin-console/commits/e9a0420792950b09a5e1b0e40497d0b43d0f2484/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T09:04:05Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix: redact admin token from proxy error logs; document key rotation\n\nThe proxy''s catch logged the raw error object; for an AxiosError that includes\nconfig.headers.Authorization — the decrypted Garage admin token — leaking it into\nlogs on any network error. Log only the error message + clusterId instead. Also\nadd an ENCRYPTION_KEY rotation runbook to the deployment docs (no auto\nre-encryption, so rotating means re-entering stored credentials).\n\nRefs #14 (proxy review + key-rotation runbook).","tree":{"sha":"b052f2d954a4df0dcc47bf936b7f3161bbb319d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/b052f2d954a4df0dcc47bf936b7f3161bbb319d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/e9a0420792950b09a5e1b0e40497d0b43d0f2484","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/e9a0420792950b09a5e1b0e40497d0b43d0f2484","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKGU5YTA0MjA3OTI5NTBiMDlhNWUxYjBlNDA0OTdkMGI0M2QwZjI0ODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654","sha":"0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654"}],"sha":"e9a0420792950b09a5e1b0e40497d0b43d0f2484","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/e9a0420792950b09a5e1b0e40497d0b43d0f2484"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T09:00:57Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"ci: add live-tests workflow (contract + E2E against an ephemeral Garage)\n\nThe offline suite gates PRs; this new workflow closes the regression gap for the\nparts that need a real backend. It stands up an ephemeral Garage in the job,\nprovisions a layout + bucket + access key, then runs the Bucket Backend API\ncontract suite (connections flavor) and the Playwright E2E against the Admin\nConsole. Runs post-merge on main + on demand, off the per-PR critical path.\n\nVALIDATE-ON-FIRST-RUN: Garage provisioning (status parsing, key-create output,\nadmin token) is version-specific and can''t be exercised locally — pin\ngarage_image to your cluster''s tag and adjust if the first run trips. The code\npaths themselves are already green against the real cluster (the contract suite\npassed 15/15 against it during this work).\n\nRefs #13.","tree":{"sha":"afcef54a0a76201d8449d98b96d5674daf9a060c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/afcef54a0a76201d8449d98b96d5674daf9a060c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDBlMDE2NzBhNzhkMjUxMmJkNjBjOWVhZjI5YTg3ZjA4YjZhYmQ2NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b","sha":"09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b"}],"sha":"0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/0e01670a78d2512bd60c9eaf29a87f08b6abd654"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T08:57:29Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"feat: add garage-admin-all single image (embedded S3 Browser, same-origin)\n\nA new image folds the static S3 Browser MF remote into the Admin Console image\nand serves it same-origin at /s3-browser, so the embedded FileBrowser needs no\nseparate container or proxy hop (its data already flows through the Admin BFF).\nThe admin BFF gains S3_BROWSER_STATIC_DIR: when set it serves the bundled remote\ndirectly (preferred over the proxy). The remote''s assetPrefix:''auto'' resolves its\nchunks under /s3-browser/ automatically.\n\nVerified locally: the BFF serves /s3-browser/mf-manifest.json + remoteEntry.js\nsame-origin and runtime-config points the host at them. Published via the release\nmatrix on the admin version. (Full embedded-FileBrowser load needs a live cluster\n— covered by the E2E in #13.)\n\nRefs #12.","tree":{"sha":"ba8cdca05a6b813a29112cad70dce1cdd7a5decf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/ba8cdca05a6b813a29112cad70dce1cdd7a5decf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDA5ZDFkMzgzY2EwMzUwODg2Mjg3MzdlMWY4ZTc5MTcxMjAxNmM5MWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/07c66b332cd449604540175f93ad42beda9fa8d0","sha":"07c66b332cd449604540175f93ad42beda9fa8d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/07c66b332cd449604540175f93ad42beda9fa8d0"}],"sha":"09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/09d1d383ca035088628737e1f8e791712016c91b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/07c66b332cd449604540175f93ad42beda9fa8d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T08:51:00Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"feat: scope auto-managed bucket CORS to the app origin, configurably\n\nThe auto-managed CORS rule for browser-direct (large-file) transfers used a\nblanket AllowedOrigins:[''*'']. Default it to the requesting app''s Origin instead;\nlet operators pin origins via S3_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS (comma-separated) or opt\nout of CORS management entirely via S3_MANAGE_CORS=false. Also fix a clobber bug:\nwhen GetBucketCors fails for a non-absent reason, skip the PutBucketCors (which\nwould replace the whole config) instead of overwriting rules we couldn''t read.\nensureBucketCors now takes allowedOrigins and keys its cache on them. cors unit\ntests: 27 -> 30. Wired through both BFFs; docs + .env examples updated.\n\nRefs #11. (No Origin header -> falls back to ''*'', so the contract suite''s\nlarge-file path is unchanged; live verification in #13.)","tree":{"sha":"22ea10d5c21d0c406b3fcf4859d7a1cc19908733","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/22ea10d5c21d0c406b3fcf4859d7a1cc19908733"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/07c66b332cd449604540175f93ad42beda9fa8d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"ht