:"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/a5905cbbc445e9f65376a15ae13cc8ac3aa57fc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T08:40:08Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"ci: format-gate the shared packages with prettier\n\nAdd prettier to the root devDeps (mirroring how eslint is provided centrally),\nplus format / format:check scripts to crypto, server-config, bucket-api-server,\nui, and tokens — reusing the root .prettierignore via --ignore-path so dist is\nexcluded without a per-package ignore file. Includes the one-time prettier\nnormalization of files in these previously-ungated packages (formatting only;\nthe full gate stays green).\n\nCloses #15 (with the lint-gating commit). Every package with logic is now\ncovered by both eslint and prettier in CI.","tree":{"sha":"e5b8c2999ee4badda7a5872dd65e1204339902cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/e5b8c2999ee4badda7a5872dd65e1204339902cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/a5905cbbc445e9f65376a15ae13cc8ac3aa57fc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.g