ng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/18f0a9d0e8105f945a867c367fd24f9196bd4b64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T08:35:35Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"ci: lint-gate the shared packages (crypto, server-config, bucket-api-server, ui, tokens)\n\nThese five packages had no lint script, so CI''s `pnpm lint` (--if-present)\nsilently skipped them — the contract heart and crypto included. Add an\neslint.config.js (a new nodeLanguageOptions variant in the base for the backend\nones) + lint/lint:fix scripts to each; eslint resolves from the root, so no new\ndependency. Fixing the violations that surfaced:\n- server-config: type executeSqliteQuery via unknown[] instead of any (the\n  no-explicit-any rule); justify the ANSI-strip regex''s control char.\n- use-tab-hotkeys: move the latest-args ref write into an effect (react-hooks/refs).\n- resource-list / expiration-picker / popover: scoped disables for intentional\n  idioms the strict React-Compiler rules over-flag (render-preserve ref for the\n  slide-out bar; impure Date in click handlers; measure-then-place setState in a\n  layout effect — popover is also flagged for Radix migration in #14).\n\nRefs #15. (format:check scripts follow in a separate commit.)","tree":{"sha":"63c12f9da972969f8afa0a2b68f5a5abc09cfbca","u