{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/80e41f4256684a194ff091661489bb2c6bdd514e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T08:22:14Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix: set security response headers on both BFFs\n\nNeither BFF sent any security headers. Add a shared createSecurityHeaders()\nmiddleware in @garage/server-config (used by both apps as the first middleware):\nX-Content-Type-Options, X-Frame-Options SAMEORIGIN, Referrer-Policy,\nX-DNS-Prefetch-Control, X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies, and HSTS. No helmet\ndependency — and deliberately no CSP / COEP / CORP, which would block the\ncross-origin Module Federation remote (revisit CSP with the same-origin\nall-in-one image). +2 server-config tests.\n\nRefs #10.","tree":{"sha":"b0262de4fe07d222ec0f922e2a2ae2e86d9f6379","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/b0262de4fe07d222ec0f922e2a2ae2e86d9f6379"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/80e41f4256684a194ff091661489bb2c6bdd514e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/80e41f4256684a194ff091661489bb2c6bdd514e","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDgwZTQxZjQyNTY2ODRhMTk0ZmYwOTE2NjE0ODliYjJjNmJkZDUxNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/e43c87768fc5fa5e90b51c8d2c174a400e384997","sha":"e43c87768fc5fa5e90b51c8d2c174a400e384997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/e43c87768fc5fa5e90b51c8d2c174a400e384997"}],"sha":"80e41f4256684a194ff091661489bb2c6bdd514e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/80e41f4256684a194ff091661489bb2c6bdd514e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/e43c87768fc5fa5e90b51c8d2c174a400e384997/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T08:18:50Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix(docker): run images as non-root and add container HEALTHCHECKs\n\nBoth production images ran as root and declared no HEALTHCHECK (only Compose\nhad one, so plain `docker run` users got none). Switch to the unprivileged\n`node` user (uid 1000) — a fresh named volume at /data inherits that ownership,\nso SQLite stays writable — and add a HEALTHCHECK hitting /api/health (served in\nboth normal and S3_BROWSER_STATIC_ONLY modes).\n\nRefs #10.","tree":{"sha":"604d9ca4a0ae1f643f9c6ea54c38976338c24001","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/604d9ca4a0ae1f643f9c6ea54c38976338c24001"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/e43c877