d (announced as a dead disabled\n  link); keep aria-current=page so it reads as the current location.\n- Meter: default aria-label so the progressbar is never unlabeled.\n- CopyValue: title the truncating span with the full value so a clipped id is\n  legible on hover. Also normalizes formatting in two files (ui isn''t yet\n  prettier-gated; see #15).\n\nRefs #7. (Checkbox hit-area expansion intentionally skipped — risks click\n  overlap in dense rows; ResourceList already pads its checkbox targets.)","tree":{"sha":"6201b3fc95ece1dea8247db09b750a51003e690e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/6201b3fc95ece1dea8247db09b750a51003e690e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/6fbc0521eff1507ce238c16157c1b830d53230d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/6fbc0521eff1507ce238c16157c1b830d53230d6","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDZmYmMwNTIxZWZmMTUwN2NlMjM4YzE2MTU3YzFiODMwZDUzMjMwZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/1270d6f7d3d7c99b86d909920cb7af37bb4c4d30","sha":"1270d6f7d3d7c99b86d909920cb7af37bb4c4d30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/1270d6f7d3d7c99b86d909920cb7af37bb4c4d30"}],"sha":"6fbc0521eff1507ce238c16157c1b830d53230d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/6fbc0521eff1507ce238c16157c1b830d53230d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/1270d6f7d3d7c99b86d909920cb7af37bb4c4d30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T07:52:32Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix(packages/web-shared): parse bare YYYY-MM-DD as local, not UTC, for display\n\nnew Date(''2026-05-31'') parses as UTC midnight, so formatDate/formatDateTime\nrendered the previous calendar day in negative-offset timezones. Parse date-only\nvalues as local midnight via a parseDisplayDate helper; full timestamps keep\ntheir explicit offset. +2 tests. (vitest pins TZ=UTC, so the offset bug itself\nisn''t reproducible there, but the date-only path is now guarded.)\n\nRefs #7.","tree":{"sha":"2b770009666e3fe1f2359201ffd1c83c2c6bfb4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/2b770009666e3fe1f2359201ffd1c83c2c6bfb4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/1270d6f7d3d7c99b86d909920cb7af37bb4c4d30","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/1270d6f7d3d7c99b86d909920cb7af37bb4c4d30","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDEyNzBkNmY3ZDNkN2M5OWI4NmQ5MDk5MjBjYjdhZjM3YmI0YzRkMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://githu