al drop\ntheir bespoke copy buttons (and the silent failure path) for the shared\nCopyButton — enforcing the don''t-fork rule. No public API change.\n\nRefs #6.","tree":{"sha":"9e8c55e61aa5eba0a1ca93934e8a0a9f20dde154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/9e8c55e61aa5eba0a1ca93934e8a0a9f20dde154"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/ff092648231741724937b3c419f3b0eb1f5def05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/ff092648231741724937b3c419f3b0eb1f5def05","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKGZmMDkyNjQ4MjMxNzQxNzI0OTM3YjNjNDE5ZjNiMGViMWY1ZGVmMDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042","sha":"13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042"}],"sha":"ff092648231741724937b3c419f3b0eb1f5def05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/ff092648231741724937b3c419f3b0eb1f5def05"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T07:38:33Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix(packages/ui): warn when ResourceList defaultSort.columnId matches no column\n\nA defaultSort whose columnId doesn''t match any column silently no-ops the initial\nsort (the key just isn''t found), so a typo or a column id renamed in a refactor\nquietly drops the default order. Add a dev console.warn that surfaces it, and\nfix the test''s emptyState icon (Inbox instead of casting Badge ''as never'').\n\nCompile-time enforcement was considered but rejected as disproportionate: it\nwould require a defineColumns helper + a readonly columns prop + rewriting all\nfive call sites away from '': ResourceListColumn<T>[]'' annotations (which widen\nthe id to string). The runtime guard catches the same bug at dev time for zero\ncall-site churn.\n\nRefs #5.","tree":{"sha":"c6b64e801c068fd04f660e4a71231f0d4145c17b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/c6b64e801c068fd04f660e4a71231f0d4145c17b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDEzZDY4YWRlMzk3NjY2ZWJmYmRmMDQ4ZTU4NTRiNTkxMDEyYWYwNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/fd9537075e0d6b5c297ce7b034d29b42686bcfed","sha":"fd9537075e0d6b5c297ce7b034d29b42686bcfed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/fd9537075e0d6b5c297ce7b034d29b42686bcfed"}],"sha":"13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/13d68ade397666ebfbdf048e5854b591012af042"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/fd9537075e0d6b5c297ce7b034d29b42686bcfed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-05T07:15:25Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-05T10:50:18Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix(packages/bucket-api-server): correct POST /upload multi-file oversize handling\n\nA single oversized file flipped batch-wide oversized/aborted flags, so files\nthat had already been stored were dropped from the response and the whole batch\n413''d (with the 413 sent while siblings were still uploading). Track oversize\nper file, and decide the status only after every upload settles via a new pure\ndecideUploadResponse(): a genuine failure (or client abort) outranks an oversize,\nan oversize still reports the files that fit, otherwise 200. The decision logic\nis now unit-tested (5 cases) without a multipart harness. Also normalizes the\nfile''s formatting (this package wasn''t previously prettier-gated). 22 -> 27 tests.\n\nRefs #15 (shared packages aren''t lint/format-gated).","tree":{"sha":"48e0a33b388a822e6a193d6bf79545aec0d3805a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/48e0a33b388a822e6a193d6bf79545aec0d3805a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/fd9537075e0d6b5c297ce7b034d29b42686bcfed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/fd9537075e0d6b5c297ce7b034d29b42686bcfed","nod