an entry when its key was looked up again, so an entry\nwhose key went idle lingered forever — and each idle S3-client kept a live\nkeep-alive HTTP agent open. Add a shared createTtlSweeper: an unref''d, self-\nstopping interval that drops expired entries (destroying idle S3Clients) without\nwaiting for a re-lookup. The existing sliding-TTL + evict-on-access behaviour is\nunchanged. bucket-api-server 19 -> 22 tests.","tree":{"sha":"a18ed8c85cd5c1634d26d915187e0bf2f828b40a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/a18ed8c85cd5c1634d26d915187e0bf2f828b40a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/ac0ceafdb0391303ebc763033418597a0437844c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/ac0ceafdb0391303ebc763033418597a0437844c","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKGFjMGNlYWZkYjAzOTEzMDNlYmM3NjMwMzM0MTg1OTdhMDQzNzg