thub.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/ae5787db47ccb0f3207218b2feec40498a9a6e9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T09:27:38Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T09:27:38Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix(ci): revert to commit status API for release PR checks\n\nworkflow_dispatch check suites are not associated with PRs, so the\ndispatched CI run doesn''t satisfy branch protection. Revert to posting\na commit status via the GitHub API, but cleaner: inline step in the\nrelease-please job using prs_created output and git ref API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e38b34c3b2f1e38a828b4f5d458141639dd23e13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/e38b34c3b2f1e38a828b4f5d458141639dd23e13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/ae5787db47ccb0f3207218b2feec40498a9a6e9f","verification":{"payload":"tree e38b34c3b2f1e38a828b4f5d458141639dd23e13\nparent f219035ca6d7d3e97e0c0f59fa25af6eba013705\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1772098058 +0800\ncommitter eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1772098058 +0800\n\nfix(ci): revert to commit status API for release PR checks\n\nworkflow_dispatch check suites are not associated with PRs, so the\ndispatched CI run doesn''t satisfy branch protection. Revert to posting\na commit status via the GitHub API, but cleaner: inline step in the\nrelease-please job using prs_created output and git ref API.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reas