hubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/f219035ca6d7d3e97e0c0f59fa25af6eba013705/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T09:19:59Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T09:19:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): add --repo flag to gh pr list in ci-status job (#9)\n\n* fix(ci): add --repo flag to gh pr list in ci-status job\n\nThe job has no checkout step, so gh cli can''t infer the repo\nfrom the git directory. Use --repo explicitly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): dispatch CI on release PR branch instead of faking status\n\nReplace the commit status API hack with workflow_dispatch. GITHUB_TOKEN\ncan trigger workflow_dispatch (unlike pull_request), so we dispatch the\nreal CI workflow on the release PR branch. This lets CI run naturally\nand report checks on the PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d90b0065e46766f6c17dbfa71d08f053e3b0885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/1d90b0065e46766f6c17dbfa71d08f053e3b0885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/f219035ca6d7d3e97e0c0f59fa25af6eba013705","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d90b0065e46766f6c17dbfa71d08f053e3b0885\nparent 3ca0362185d887f6a655cf208e9fb62306785a3f\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1772097599 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772097599 +0800\n\nfix(ci): add --repo flag to gh pr list in ci-status job (#9)\n\n* fix(ci): add --repo flag to gh pr list in ci-status job\n\nThe job has no checkout step, so gh cli can''t infer the repo\nfrom the git directory. Use --repo explicitly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(ci): dispatch CI on release PR branch instead of faking status\n\nReplace the commit status API hack with workflow_dispatch. GITHUB_TOKEN\ncan trigger workflow_dispatch (unlike pull_request), so we dispatch the\nreal CI workflow on the release PR branch. This lets CI run naturally\nand report checks on the PR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpoBA/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcxoQAE6RpgvQtZNB15zmwkYfSjtq\nxR/a9B5ha5QHa4aZ3cZSgmUMiPj5a/uGyH0fQPyrPSrSCJkq7V5zXkty8kYIlPwY\nVVwDikyd/i3jKiprh07koZcrD9ES7vThcwuL39+vkx7z2p3xfRerPDi/6v4b87Pj\njElRFy1udJzzK1tH3qqinny5p4qmLz2nVUwgGoTcyVygJh8s6DHA5X48RA9jB/eF\ngLwfMka1L/x8M90SAQG6YkrIJjeiSZVd3YkqHI6b4b87+n74GsE3J1cnH/6NGeIl\nfLu3tV4CCN096j9WkcXBVitLHi4gribsxbdLC/aYNEJvLfTGompBUrzDiKXVpnIy\nSNjDw7k9ahip0UMJ18ITPJVb2K2+nsWLrDSf7CisDRqcSDEOWMwb4A8uoVvR0wlL\nEROIy6VpxuLfXoypTHpUb1Bg891svK6JeiXi1GBrm82trug5ilEt9BH2wKXtBrVz\nwmTAQ+vzhx7qlP4c8wc1gKolh02Hjl2W/hyGgucuf0HpggeieSJchHz/UF4EzgCI\nVR4gK/91898jMPmp