"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/0af1c54ae5361390d72230e02116cf0e9bac2b69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T08:48:05Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T08:48:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): pass tag_name to release workflow for Docker tag generation (#6)\n\nworkflow_call runs without a tag ref context, so docker/metadata-action\nsemver rules produce empty tags. Pass tag_name from release-please\noutputs and use it as explicit value for semver patterns. Also checkout\nthe tag ref to build the exact release code, and add packages:write\npermission for Docker image push.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b0e6ce9c4e00d354a71942ef632bf64afe4934b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/b0e6ce9c4e00d354a71942ef632bf64afe4934b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/0af1c54ae5361390d72230e02116cf0e9bac2b69","verification":{"payload":"tree b0e6ce9c4e00d354a71942ef632bf64afe4934b8\nparent 6acdd300b9b747ef06c380bd59296fcd02436057\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1772095685 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772095685 +0800\n\nfix(ci): pass tag_name to release workflow for Docker tag generation (#6)\n\nworkflow_call runs without a tag ref context, so docker/metadata-action\nsemver rules produce empty tags. Pass tag_name from release-please\noutputs and use it as explicit value for semver patterns. Also checkout\nthe tag ref to build the exact release code, and add packages:write\npermission for Docker image push.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpoAjFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHoEQAAlBaCBpQMfJX+GdlkeNTPVo\nrbovn2LSNR9F1q0ZekOs9YIL9fpsCtTrpu3h7M+wCu7KFgCeoa/cFET/Cr4Q3ZqQ\n