s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/5dbd46345587c29432d5085282f7957a4b77dc94","node_id":"C_kwDORZGCMtoAKDVkYmQ0NjM0NTU4N2MyOTQzMmQ1MDg1MjgyZjc5NTdhNGI3N2RjOTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commit/58e9cfb924efefda5a125ce144e7edd37407734f","sha":"58e9cfb924efefda5a125ce144e7edd37407734f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/58e9cfb924efefda5a125ce144e7edd37407734f"}],"sha":"5dbd46345587c29432d5085282f7957a4b77dc94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/5dbd46345587c29432d5085282f7957a4b77dc94"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eyebrowkang","id":48169104,"login":"eyebrowkang","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MTY5MTA0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/58e9cfb924efefda5a125ce144e7edd37407734f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-26T07:30:06Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-26T07:30:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Optimize docker image (#1)\n\n* chore: optimize Docker image size\n\n- Add --prod flag to pnpm deploy to exclude devDependencies\n- Remove musl-only native binaries (Debian uses glibc)\n\nReduces image size from ~700MB to ~560MB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove unused Prisma WASM, source maps, and type declarations\n\n- Remove query compiler WASM for non-SQLite databases (cockroachdb,\n  mysql, postgresql, sqlserver) from both Prisma client and CLI\n- Remove .js.map, .mjs.map source maps from node_modules\n- Remove .d.ts, .d.mts type declarations from node_modules\n\nReduces image size from ~560MB to ~440MB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: migrate from Prisma to Drizzle ORM\n\nReplace Prisma ORM (~140MB in production) with Drizzle ORM (~2MB) to\nsignificantly reduce Docker image size. The database schema and data\nare fully compatible — existing databases work without modification.\n\n- Replace @prisma/client, @prisma/adapter-libsql, prisma with drizzle-orm\n- Add drizzle-kit as dev dependency for migration generation\n- Create Drizzle schema (api/src/db/schema.ts) matching existing tables\n- Create Drizzle client (api/src/db/index.ts) reusing @libsql/client\n- Add programmatic migration runner (api/src/db/migrate.ts)\n- Migrate all route queries (clusters, proxy, health check)\n- Use returning() + empty array check instead of Prisma P2025 errors\n- Run migrations automatically on app startup (no separate CLI step)\n- Simplify Dockerfile: remove prisma generate, engine cleanup, openssl\n- Simplify Docker CMD from shell wrapper to direct node invocation\n- Remove Prisma generate step from CI and release workflows\n- Update all documentation to reflect Drizzle ORM usage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove stale Prisma references and optimize production deps\n\n- Update README.md, README.zh.md, CHANGELOG.md: replace Prisma → Drizzle\n- Remove Prisma from pnpm-workspace.yaml onlyBuiltDependencies\n- Add pnpm overrides to exclude drizzle-orm optional peer deps\n  (@prisma/client, prisma, @electric-sql/pglite, mysql2, postgres)\n- Restore Dockerfile cleanup: remove musl binaries and .d.ts files\n- Regenerate lockfile to purge stale Prisma resolution entries\n\nImage size: 438MB → 266MB (with both ORM migration and dep cleanup)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: switch Docker base image from Debian slim to Alpine\n\nReplace node:24-slim with node:24-alpine for both build and production\nstages. This eliminates the need for manual cleanup of musl/glibc\nnative binaries and .d.ts files — Alpine natively uses musl, so\npnpm-deployed packages work without post-processing.\n\nAlso simplifies tini installation (apk vs apt-get).\n\nImage size: 266MB (Debian slim + cleanup) → 215MB (Alpine, no cleanup)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b62badac4003b47d8f90efaf2150ddecb8b50647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/b62badac4003b47d8f90efaf2150ddecb8b50647"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/58e9cfb924efefda5a125ce144e7edd37407734f","verification":{"payload":"tree b62badac4003b47d8f90efaf2150ddecb8b50647\nparent dd89de637c1e739ddafff37ef2e660c00ab64e9a\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1772091006 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1772091006 +0800\n\nOptimize docker image (#1)\n\n* chore: optimize Docker image size\n\n- Add --prod flag to pnpm deploy to exclude devDependencies\n- Remove musl-only native binaries (Debian uses glibc)\n\nReduces image size from ~700MB to ~560MB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove unused Prisma WASM, source maps, and type declarations\n\n- Remove query compiler WASM for non-SQLite databases (cockroachdb,\n  mysql, postgresql, sqlserver) from both Prisma client and CLI\n- Remove .js.map, .mjs.map source maps from node_modules\n- Remove .d.ts, .d.mts type declarations from node_modules\n\nReduces image size from ~560MB to ~440MB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: migrate from Prisma to Drizzle ORM\n\nReplace Prisma ORM (~140MB in production) with Drizzle ORM (~2MB) to\nsignificantly reduce Docker image size. The database schema and data\nare fully compatible — existing databases work without modification.\n\n- Replace @prisma/client, @prisma/adapter-libsql, prisma with drizzle-orm\n- Add drizzle-kit as dev dependency for migration generation\n- Create Drizzle schema (api/src/db/schema.ts) matching existing tables\n- Create Drizzle client (api/src/db/index.ts) reusing @libsql/client\n- Add programmatic migration runner (api/src/db/migrate.ts)\n- Migrate all route queries (clusters, proxy, health check)\n- Use returning() + empty array check instead of Prisma P2025 errors\n- Run migrations automatically on app startup (no separate CLI step)\n- Simplify Dockerfile: remove prisma generate, engine cleanup, openssl\n- Simplify Docker CMD from shell wrapper to direct node invocation\n- Remove Prisma generate step from CI and release workflows\n- Update all documentation to reflect Drizzle ORM usage\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: remove stale Prisma references and optimize production deps\n\n- Update README.md, README.zh.md, CHANGELOG.md: replace Prisma → Drizzle\n- Remove Prisma from pnpm-workspace.yaml onlyBuiltDependencies\n- Add pnpm overrides to exclude drizzle-orm optional peer deps\n  (@prisma/client, prisma, @electric-sql/pglite, mysql2, postgres)\n- Restore Dockerfile cleanup: remove musl binaries and .d.ts files\n- Regenerate lockfile to purge stale Prisma resolution entries\n\nImage size: 438MB → 266MB (with both ORM migration and dep cleanup)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: switch Docker base image from Debian slim to Alpine\n\nReplace node:24-slim with node:24-alpine for both build and production\nstages. This eliminates the need for manual cleanup of musl/glibc\nnative binaries and .d.ts files — Alpine natively uses musl, so\npnpm-deployed packages work without post-processing.\n\nAlso simplifies tini installation (apk vs apt-get).\n\nImage size: 266MB (Debian slim + cleanup) → 215MB (Alpine, no cleanup)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpn/Z+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAxj4QAES6eGMW8vAT2QqSS2kObUnd\nqD8i5c3VbY5IPSIu1y6NCRhzaFkOe2CQ+ywN1RVJgDw+oND+z7T1f28Fr++Y09H/\nDB6VHrwjxP65bb2Hy8CckUUHCdhzYxXhJVPo0Jol7ujd3s0CYId0HF3Obj+5VRFJ\ng4d39V5j38nR3/GAxZQJj3EiL5aocK5caedMjV3iWcX2KSW0USs9K8iji8w6bxfY\nO9MyaP3qPmGCzuDN15fD4C66haFohxur0Q0P9knesqx8mfN3okZj6szpC4Wvt+QK\nFw99Z5wnUVt5PnNIvkWn8YVc1woUrFa2t/UdKhwwBcVyMbbRu8JdkFO0pd4hpf/6\nFuzEat86iAuXF9cIRndvi/ehieWesI0ezxGzklcoeGAb0vdEM+EUSt3B+RRV+ws1\nMALnFiBds3XLGHMKhE8CX2/YC6XK2vMwPwaUwEz1d2NrxYYTr5J6GU6wv3/dj2I6\n0mGW+wJzNZ8kvSbKFJBcGKRszlsD2wnRjGX/ctWzMoCXbqnxW8JnRPXLBhxb0h+/\nKo0IEqpvH9PfbzPBvwRSIddCvioXtCe3FVHm0CYY9/nNjmyXZkRDlRFYZeNvT6RJ\ni3mAiL1IFzrIRgZevrMjhyB1ManjZv1+3woTtIxIQoJKwAXpunsK8Sg4DR6pb5s+\nk1CYvMmj4fC8252HWZ/F\n=6qkJ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-26T07:30:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":