 refetch() operated on the\nold query key before React re-rendered with showSecretKey=true. Fixed by making\na direct API call instead of relying on query key changes.\n\nAlso moved the Grant Access form from an inline card section to a dialog\ntriggered by a button in the card header, reducing visual clutter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1995ea83318709a2e49c56929e09badb28e4c570","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/1995ea83318709a2e49c56929e09badb28e4c570"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/cf7f13d36e3f0d272cce43c98a6e66b84e3f1ccf","verification":{"payload":"tree 1995ea83318709a2e49c56929e09badb28e4c570\nparent 6cdab02ab800a097642acf1c46398e894696ccbe\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1771942660 +0800\ncommitter eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1771942660 +0800\n\nfix(web): fix Reveal Secret race condition and move Grant Access to dialog\n\nThe Reveal Secret button required two clicks because refetch() operated on the\nold query key before React re-rendered with showSecretKey=true. Fixed by making\na direct API call instead of relying on query key changes.\n\nAlso moved the Grant Access form from an inline card section to a dialog\ntriggered by a button in the card header, reducing visual clutter.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSVq/oO79t42BXZLa98EPm7SDwpoQUCaZ2zBAAKCRB8EPm7SDwp\nodIcAQDBMk28dtlZr3ltX6h8hp1FuPedG8lvojBmVrg9fu6HtAEA85Ynmb5FwwAP\nkXKlt2P1xzf0RmDO6EqWOvJMiYWDrQI=\n=mD56\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-26T02:17:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/48169104?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyebrowkang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github