,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/commits/1c11128cec489d6325df009f5cbd193f69c135e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-07T03:48:49Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-07T03:48:49Z","email":"me@eyebrowkang.com","name":"eyebrowkang"},"message":"fix(docker): fix env vars, base image, and example ENCRYPTION_KEY\n\n- Switch from Alpine to Debian slim: libsql native module requires\n  glibc (Alpine''s musl libc lacks fcntl64 symbol)\n- Fix example ENCRYPTION_KEY from 33 to 32 characters\n- Add openssl to production image (required by Prisma)\n- Suppress dotenv log noise when no .env file is present\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a82802d1f45d4bdda2aad40e4bfa70fe6b9a8e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/trees/a82802d1f45d4bdda2aad40e4bfa70fe6b9a8e5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eyebrowkang/garage-admin-console/git/commits/1c11128cec489d6325df009f5cbd193f69c135e6","verification":{"payload":"tree a82802d1f45d4bdda2aad40e4bfa70fe6b9a8e5d\nparent a6e50501eb0f3d210da334e87278d27b22602956\nauthor eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1770436129 +0800\ncommitter eyebrowkang <me@eyebrowkang.com> 1770436129 +0800\n\nfix(docker): fix env vars, base image, and example ENCRYPTION_KEY\n\n- Switch from Alpine to Debian slim: libsql native module requires\n  glibc (Alpine''s musl libc lacks fcntl64 symbol)\n- Fix example ENCRYPTION_KEY from 33 to 32 characters\n- Add openssl to production image (required by Prisma)\n- Suppress dotenv log noise when no .env file is present\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQSVq/oO79t42BXZLa98EPm7SDwpoQUCaYa2IQAKCRB8EPm7SDwp\noTA6APoDIvjfJZ8M3H+N9fhkq6BcJaUNQEc+ApOw4eMgZXLorAD+IBp9o4ti62/t\n5QabouLyAlEIOkbE+4B86f7fjPL7vgA=\n=F9Aq\n-----END PGP SIGNATU