-06T17:36:11Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:36:11Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"fix(till): payment window shows + charges the server total incl. VAT (§AUDIT A4)\n\nThe cart''s own total has no tax; the server adds VAT. The till now keeps the draft''s server totals\nfrom every sync and the payment window uses them (VAT line, cash change). GATES has no tax rate today,\nso nobody was short-changed yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae9195a127dd4eb53724a2323e6e1cec7b37b735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/ae9195a127dd4eb53724a2323e6e1cec7b37b735"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/39b89a46b00bdb12864cad71bd93fde79c3309cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/comm