ebt (§AUDIT A2/A3)\n\nBefore: checkout ran with paid=0, then a 2nd call paid the FULL total with any method — Ajel included —\nso credit sales never became debt; with credit selling off EVERY till sale was refused; a cash sale\ncould be blocked by the credit limit. Payments endpoint now refuses Ajel, zero/negative, overpay,\nand non-posted invoices. Ajel needs a named customer. 7 tests + a real run on dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c96287ee15ca057936ac5d2de21c94294705b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/3c96287ee15ca057936ac5d2de21c94294705b9c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/994f20829d4466df6dc2bbd4e5cc6025f4f9d1b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/commit/994f20829d4466df6dc2bbd4e5cc6025f4f9d1b5","node_id":"C_kwDORZNBSdoAKDk5NGYyMDgyOWQ0NDY2ZGY2ZGMyYmJkNGU1Y2M2MDI1ZjRmOWQxYjU"