endorya"},"message":"feat(s146): sidebar accordion + search fuzzy + units in edit modal\n\nC — Sidebar accordion: opening a nav group now auto-collapses the\n    previously open one (AppSidebar toggle function).\n\nD — Global search bar improvements: expanded PAGES list to cover all\n    routes (Memory Base, Transfers, Import/Export, Storage, Capabilities,\n    POS Settings, Profile, Notifications, Billing); added per-page keyword\n    aliases so \"clock\" finds POS Settings, \"fefo\" finds Capabilities etc.;\n    added fuzzy subsequence-match fallback with \"Did you mean…\" header when\n    no exact hit.\n\nE — Selling units now editable from Inventory list edit button: removed the\n    !prodModal.id guard, replaced equation-style UI with table-style editor\n    (name · pcs factor · sell price · delete row) for both new and edit;\n    openEditProduct now loads existing selling_units; saveProduct sends\n    selling_units in PATCH as well as POST. Cleaned up orphaned prodDefaults\n    fields (unit_spp/pps/sell_base) and onUnitFieldChange.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8219002c1d4113ecfe57a825827732c1a84b5aef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/8219002c1d4113ecfe57a825827732c1a84b5aef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/26fb36233c3ab4ab81a6fd3fc6fdf5751ca8b7f6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1",