/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/commits/d79f869441249cb620c3d82bdbd985227647bb46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:28:55Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-28T13:28:55Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s145): §POS-UI step 1 — topbar polish + Exit badge + POS-button shimmer\n\nPOS topbar: searchbar capped width (no longer spans the bar), dark-mode\ntoggle + AR/EN language switcher (reuse theme store + locale, persisted),\ncashier name bigger/bolder, clock bigger + boxed. Replaced the icon-only\nback arrow with a labeled ''Exit'' badge that navigates to /dashboard and\nforce-expands the left sidebar — plain navigation, the cart/held sale\npersists (not a cancel). Sidebar POS button now shimmers every 1.5s (a\n::before light-sweep, tooltip-safe) while a POS invoice is still open\n(cart not empty), reminding the user to finish the sale. i18n pos.exit\nEN+AR.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ded4e268d8ad8bbc811710bb9cef9515bf255ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/8ded4e268d8ad8bbc811710bb9cef9515bf255ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/d79f869441249cb620c3d82bdbd985227647bb46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/u