de searches all products\nand ranks STORE above MB via _src_rank annotation; store_history mode\nfilters STORE-only and returns no_history=true when empty. Response\nshape changed from plain array to {results, no_history} — backward\ncompatible (Purchases.vue already uses res.data.results ?? res.data).\n\nregister_memory_base_entry gated on mb_auto_register.\n\nCapabilities.vue: new Search & Autocomplete card with mode-btn source\ntoggle + mb_auto_register checkbox + ? explainer. i18n EN+AR.\nPurchases.vue: ac-no-history inline hint when store_history returns 0\nresults. Changelog 1.19.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c35f6ac053095e5bb2127546ed298f867994b0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/1c35f6ac053095e5bb2127546ed298f867994b0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/f9ab8d6d773d4f230bf64a3a2b01e1d0f362c8cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},