se + reopen-to-edit button + new priority queue\n\nA1: new-product detail panel (item-extra) collapses on deliberate double-Enter\n(two Enters ≤600ms, no other key between). Any non-Enter keystroke resets the\nsequence. SELECT elements excluded. Animated via existing <Transition name=\"expand\">.\n\nA2: ChevronDown reopen button in new 7th grid column (28px). Shows only on collapsed\nnew-product rows. reopenRow() collapses all other open panels first (one-at-a-time).\ni18n reopen_details key added EN+AR. Changelog 1.18.1.\n\nA3 (configurable defaults) + A4 (duplicate-attr cleanup) parked.\n\nTODO: added §MB-TWIN (autocomplete source setting + Capabilities) · §SEARCH-TS\n(Typesense VPS-wide, typo tolerance + Arabic fuzzy) · §AC-AR · §PM-REDESIGN (33.png)\n· §POS-AR · §POS-UI in priority order. STATUS.md updated. Conversation.txt + 33.png\nadded to repo root for reference.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"27b43535872090d8e77c7dbf8b2d19b1e3b9f08e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/27b43535872090d8e77c7dbf8b2d19b1e3b9f08e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/10cff797bb1baedd4859f4841fdc416c1f524a05","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.gi