t\ni18n EN+AR. Receipt: print_data returns unit_name (base→null), InvoicePrint\nrenders \"Name · Strip\".\n\nPH3 resolved (drop): removed per-invoice PAID/OUTSTANDING columns from\nSupplierDetail purchase-history (meaningless under running-account); real\nbalance lives in the statement cards. Changelog 1.11.1 + 1.11.2.\n\nLogged next POS batch (§Q fast qty entry + over-stock guard, §WT weight\ndefault unit KG↔g, §ST store-type de-emphasis) + parked per-invoice AP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8294d6b42e6b6a989b31b71ea2fe623a7cb71cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/f8294d6b42e6b6a989b31b71ea2fe623a7cb71cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/6a8f3c2b3003108b53919562a0c13cfa22ae2f36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/commit/6a8f3c2b3003108b53919562a0c13cfa22ae2f36","node_id":"C_kwDORZNBS