ubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/commits/5151d42ed737b5effa0c6b74cdc5b572898fd7b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:27:54Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T20:27:54Z","email":"pincakez@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vendorya"},"message":"feat(s127): §PH3 supplier payable — running-account payments\n\nAudit: supplier outstanding balance + purchase-history statement + the\nfrontend display already existed. Two gaps closed:\n\n1. Record supplier payment (running-account model, Yakot''s call): new\n   finance.SupplierPayment (migration 0011) recorded against the supplier\n   as a whole, not allocated per-invoice. SupplierPaymentViewSet (MANAGER\n   write / ADMIN delete, ?supplier= filter) at /api/finance/supplier-payments/.\n   SupplierDetail.vue: Record Payment button + modal (amount/date/method/note)\n   + payments history table with delete + mini-statement info card\n   (Total Purchased / Total Paid / Outstanding). EN+AR i18n.\n\n2. Balance bug: SupplierViewSet counted ALL non-deleted purchases incl.\n   DRAFT; AP-aging counted RECEIVED-only. Now balance = Sum(RECEIVED\n   purchase totals) - Sum(payments) via two Subqueries (no join blow-up),\n   consistent with AP-aging. Serializer exposes received_total/payments_total.\n\nVerified: rolled-back shell test (payment 225->125, DRAFT excluded stays\n125, receive ->375, zero rejected 400) + Playwright (record 50 -> Cash row\n+ outstanding 225->175, delete cleans up, 0 console errors). Build + Django\ncheck clean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8924df0a93857b5eeb737639cd2b6dcf25260ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/8924df0a93857b5eeb737639cd2b6dcf25260ae2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/5151d42ed737b5effa0c6b74cdc5b572898fd7b2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/commit/5151d42ed7