ing\nthe ledger\" was already closed. Fixed the 3 real gaps found instead:\n\n- A: Products.vue swallowed a failed opening-stock adjustment (saved at 0,\n  toast lied \"Saved\") -> warning toast (showWarningToast + .app-toast-warning)\n- B: branch transfers were invisible in the Stock Movement Ledger report ->\n  added TRANSFER_OUT/IN half-moves in reports/views.py\n- C: new StockAdjustment.Reason.OPENING (migration inventory.0014) for\n  initial/imported stock instead of COUNT_CORRECTION\n\nGitignored apk/ + index.xapk (233M PH6 source). Changelog 1.10.1.\nDjango check + build clean; backend shell test ALL PASS; Playwright verified.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"080e81662dd5566720b6b16c1d3d28e7235add6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/080e81662dd5566720b6b16c1d3d28e7235add6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/43f6baec654845f1281697b87ce2d3a926446a3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com