ithub.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/commits/019fcc2eaa25adc64c2d826f98f9e952d5850834/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T00:15:45Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T00:15:45Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"fix(i18n): escape bare @ in email placeholders — fixes prod-only broken Add Customer/Staff modals\n\nReal root cause of the s103/s104 modal bug: email_ph translation values\n(email@example.com / ahmed@example.com) contained a bare @, which vue-i18n\nparses as linked-message syntax. The compile error throws during the modal''s\nrender in the production build only (dev just warns), aborting the modal\nsubtree so the Add button did nothing. Suppliers was immune — literal HTML\nplaceholder, never routed through t().\n\n- Escape all 4 (en+ar) as {''@''} literal interpolation\n- Add scripts/check-i18n-at.mjs guard, wired as prebuild → blocks the build\n  on any future un-escaped @ (+ npm run i18n:check / i18n:fix)\n- Changelog 1.5.1; STATUS/TODO corrected (s105)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropi