:07:29Z","email":"pincakez@gmail.com","name":"Yakot"},"message":"feat(people): simple/expandable modals for Supplier + Staff; new contact fields\n\nSupplier (new & edit): simple view = name + phone + email; expand arrow reveals\ncompany name, whatsapp, instagram, website, country/city, notes, and the prefix\nrow. Prefix is auto-checked on open so the user can Register with name only.\n\nStaff: simple view = first+last name + phone + email (save with name only);\nexpand reveals whatsapp, username (auto-generated if blank), password\n(auto-generated if blank), role selector, and active toggle. Removes\nusername/password as hard requirements from the save button.\n\nBackend contact fields (company_name, phone_number, whatsapp_number, email,\ninstagram, website, country, city, notes) wired through both serializers —\nadded in previous session, now surfaced in the UI.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0c2ea9fa6254a196896ffa883825bcb0b6cfecc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/trees/0c2ea9fa6254a196896ffa883825bcb0b6cfecc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pincakez/vendorya-frontend/git/commits/ee9dbfd6a38bdd2bc4d2c50ea43b98f8f1ea9ece","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25075945?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pincakez","id":25075945,"login":"pincakez","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDc1OTQ1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pincakez/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com