Screen & add liquid glass UI effects\n\n- Redesign PlayerScreen: full-screen immersive artwork with Ken Burns zoom, cinematic gradients, left-aligned track info, minimalist white progress bar, collapsible sleep timer drawer\n- Add liquid glass CSS classes (liquid-glass-sm, liquid-glass-play, liquid-glass-pill, liquid-glass-pill-active) with backdrop-filter blur/saturate/brightness and inset shadows\n- Apply liquid glass to all PlayerScreen buttons: back, favorite, mixer, skip, timer toggle, timer pills\n- Update PlayPauseButton to liquid-glass-play instead of solid primary fill\n- Apply liquid-glass-sm to MiniPlayer play/pause button\n- Fix mix skip: add setDisplayTrack to useAudioPlayer, create mix-aware skip handlers cycling only active mix tracks\n- Update progress bar thumb to white with subtle glow","tree":{"sha":"d2831b796bac9ebf5451592b79f182db850e5368","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsw1996/soundpillow/git/trees/d2831b796bac9ebf5451592b79f182db850e5368"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jsw1996/soundpillow/git/commits/ce2bfc26a256ac8d2f7398bf858497e16938b4d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45106387?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jsw1996","id":45106387,"login":"jsw1996","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTA2Mzg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsw1996/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: