cture, API)\n- Domain-Driven Design: Aggregate Roots, Value Objects, Domain Events\n- CQRS with MediatR: Commands, Queries, Pipeline Behaviors\n- FluentValidation: Automatic request validation\n- EF Core with SQLite: Fluent API configurations for all entities\n- RESTful API: Products (CRUD), Orders, Categories, Dashboard\n- Scalar OpenAPI: Interactive API documentation\n- Serilog: Structured logging with request timing\n- Auto-seeding: 15 products, 5 categories, 2 customers\n- RFC 7807 ProblemDetails: Standardized error handling","tree":{"sha":"c93d039bb46a3d77fec84299beae921a3d4e12a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riyanmohmmeed-dev/NexCart/git/trees/c93d039bb46a3d77fec84299beae921a3d4e12a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/riyanmohmmeed-dev/NexCart/git/commits/5122b11d1016511ab3dd8c81f3db115a76d69f7c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/260032586?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/riyanmohmmeed-dev","id":260032586,"login":"riyanmohmmeed-dev","node_id":"U_kgDOD3_ISg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/riyanmohmmeed-dev","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi